(522, 'f411d4dc-43b0-4d3d-9b6d-b8c94efdab3b', 7919, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'write_app_js_final', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"write_app_js_final-turn-2\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Now I have the full picture of pages and navigate calls. Key facts:\\n\\n**WB.pages keys (23 total):**\\n- pages-core.js: home, search, settings\\n- pages-work.js: work, todo, inbox, projects, projectDetail(id), log, meetings\\n- pages-study.js: study, tree, knowledgeDetail(id), questions, wrong, plans, checkin, current\\n- pages-note.js: note, noteList, noteEdit(id), ideas, review\\n\\n**WB.navigate calls (19):**\\n- \'#/work/todo\' with {filter}\\n- \'#/work/inbox\' (no params)\\n- \'#/work/projects\' with {kw}\\n- \'#/work/project/\' + id with {tab}\\n- \'#/work/log\' with {date}\\n- \'#/work/meetings\' (no params)\\n- \'#/study/tree\' with p (params)\\n- \'#/study/questions\' with {mod, tag, src, kw}\\n- \'#/study/wrong\' with {tab}\\n- \'#/study/plans\' with {type}\\n- \'#/study/checkin\' (no params) - 3 times\\n- \'#/study/current\' with {month, tag}\\n- \'#/note/list\' with {mood, tag, kw, select}\\n- \'#/note/ideas\' with {select}\\n- \'#/note/review\' with {month} - 2 times\\n\\nSo hash patterns: #/work/todo, #/work/inbox, #/work/projects, #/work/project/:id, #/work/log, #/work/meetings, #/study/tree, #/study/questions, #/study/wrong, #/study/plans, #/study/checkin, #/study/current, #/note/list, #/note/ideas, #/note/review, plus #/study/knowledge/:id, #/note/edit/:id, #/home, #/search, #/settings, #/work, #/study, #/note.\\n\\nRoute mapping needed:\\n- #/home → home\\n- #/search → search\\n- #/settings → settings\\n- #/work → work\\n- #/work/todo → todo\\n- #/work/inbox → inbox\\n- #/work/projects → projects\\n- #/work/project/:id → projectDetail(id)\\n- #/work/log → log\\n- #/work/meetings → meetings\\n- #/study → study\\n- #/study/tree → tree\\n- #/study/knowledge/:id → knowledgeDetail(id)\\n- #/study/questions → questions\\n- #/study/wrong → wrong\\n- #/study/plans → plans\\n- #/study/checkin → checkin\\n- #/study/current → current\\n- #/note → note\\n- #/note/list → noteList\\n- #/note/edit/:id → noteEdit(id)\\n- #/note/ideas → ideas\\n- #/note/review → review\\n\\nNow I need to check store.js and utils.js briefly to understand WB.store, WB.store.get, settings shape, and helper functions like $, el, WB.confirmDialog etc. Also check index.html structure (sidebar/topbar/content ids) and CSS classes. Let me read store.js, utils.js, index.html quickly (small files). Also check pages-core.js around settings page for WB.applyTheme usage and the duplicate style attribute issue.\\n\\nLet me do these reads in parallel. index.html is 1059 bytes, store.js and utils.js unknown sizes. Let me read them with limit.\",\"content\":\"已确认 23 个页面键与 19 处 WB.navigate 调用形态。现在读取 store/utils/index.html 及 pages-core.js 关键片段以对齐 API。\",\"summary\":\"已确认 23 个页面键与 19 处 WB.navigate 调用形态。现在读取 store/utils/index.html 及 pages-core.js 关键片段以对齐 API。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":2,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}}', '2026-08-03 10:13:29'),
