(554, 'f411d4dc-43b0-4d3d-9b6d-b8c94efdab3b', 8667, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'write_app_js_final', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"write_app_js_final-turn-4\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Now I need to check:\\n1. pages-core.js settings page (lines 283-360) to see how applyTheme is invoked and the exact signature expected, and the duplicate style attribute issue.\\n2. CSS file to know class names for sidebar/topbar (collapsed class, etc.), e.g. `.sidebar.collapsed`, `.nav-item`, `.topbar`, `.sidebar-toggle` etc.\\n\\nLet me read pages-core.js lines 283-360 and check CSS for sidebar/topbar classes. Also check what page title / nav conventions might exist. Also check pages-work.js line 476 topbar-icon-btn usage (in projectDetail page? Actually line 476 has data-set button - that\'s page-internal). \\n\\nAlso I should check how `WB.pages.home` etc. expect to be invoked — they return {html, bind}. The bind likely receives params. Let me check one page bind signature, e.g. pages-work.js projectDetail bind and todo bind, to understand how params are consumed (e.g., bind(params) where params.filter etc.). Quick grep for \\\"bind(\\\" and \\\"params\\\" in pages.\\n\\nLet me read pages-core.js 283-360, CSS classes list, and grep \\\"bind\\\" definitions in a page file (e.g., pages-work.js lines 126-260 todo). I\'ll be selective.\",\"content\":\"设置页与 CSS 类名需对齐。读取 pages-core.js 设置页片段、CSS 中 sidebar/topbar 相关类，并抽查页面 bind 的 params 消费方式。\",\"summary\":\"设置页与 CSS 类名需对齐。读取 pages-core.js 设置页片段、CSS 中 sidebar/topbar 相关类，并抽查页面 bind 的 params 消费方式。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":4,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}}', '2026-08-03 10:13:55'),
