app.js/routing edge cases manually.\\n\\nAlso possible issue: in app.js, using `matchMedia` — exists in browsers; in my node smoke test I won\'t load app.js. Fine.\\n\\nOne more: the topbar search — make it a button; gear icon button; both with title attributes.\\n\\nAlso ensure clicking nav when sidebar collapsed still navigates (data-path handler works regardless).\\n\\nAvatar click → toast \'本地个人工作台 · v0.1.0\'.\\n\\nLet me write CSS file content now. I\'ll write it in one go (~700 lines). Then store.js, router.js, app.js, stubs, index.html.\\n\\nAlso, double-check store.subscribe usage: home page could subscribe to re-render? Not necessary. Skip subscriptions in pages; provide API anyway.\\n\\nFor the settings font slider fill update: on input, update `--fill` percent: `(v-min)/(max-min)*100`.\\n\\nEdge case in modal: input inside modal — Escape key closes modal, fine.\\n\\nclearAll confirmation: use the generic modal; wire input listener after openModal returns mask.\\n\\nImport preview table: collections counts via store.summary() after validate — validateImport returns info.counts. Show rows: 待办 N / 收件箱 N / ... That\'s 14 rows — use compact two-column layout or just key counts in a .kv-grid. I\'ll render a small table with 板块名+数量, 2 per row grid.\\n\\nNow — writing. Let me produce the files.\\n\\nFor app.js home mount checkbox listener: delegate on container: `el.addEventListener(\'change\', e => { if (e.target.matches(\'.todo-check\')) {...} })`. Same for mood chips (click), save note button, quick buttons (delegate click with data-nav), checkin button.\\n\\nSearch page mount: input event with debounce; tab clicks; result clicks (delegate).\\n\\nSettings mount: as planned.\\n\\nAlso — IMPORTANT: after theme/fontSize change via settings, other pages (home/search) will reflect automatically because CSS vars are global. \\n\\nNow write files!\\n\\nLet me carefully compose store.js seed with valid ids and consistent fields. I\'ll write now.\\n\\nAdditional detail — store.exportJSON returns deep copy (JSON round trip). importJSON(json) validates and merges.\\n\\nvalidateImport(json):\\n```js\\nif (!json || typeof json !== \'object\') return {ok:false, error:\'文件内容不是有效的 JSON 对象\'};\\nif (typeof json.data !== \'object\' || json.data === null) return {ok:false, error:\'缺少 data 数据区（可能不是本应用导出的文件）\'};\\n// optional: if json.app && json.app !== \'个人工作台\' warn but continue? accept.\\ncounts computed over known keys.\\nreturn {ok:true, info:{app: json.app, version: json.version, exportedAt: json.exportedAt, counts, hasSettings: !!json.settings}};\\n```\\n\\nimportJSON(json):\\n```js\\nconst s = json.settings && typeof json.settings===\'object\' ? json.settings : {};\\nconst settings = Object.assign(defaultSettings(), {\\n  theme: [\'light\',\'dark\',\'system\'].includes(s.theme) ? s.theme : \'system\',\\n  fontSize: Number.isFinite(+s.fontSize) ? Math.min(22, Math.max(12, +s.fontSize)) : 15,\\n  sidebarCollapsed: !!s.sidebarCollapsed\\n});\\nconst data = seedData();\\nObject.keys(data).forEach(k => {\\n  if (Array.isArray(json.data[k])) {\\n    data[k] = json.data[k].map(it => (it && typeof it===\'object\') ? it : {text:String(it)});\\n    // 确保 id 存在\\n    data[k].forEach(it => { if (!it.id) it.id = uid(); });\\n  }\\n});\\nstate.settings = settings; state.data = data; save();\\n```\\n\\nclearAll(): `state.data = seedData(); save();` — settings kept.\\n\\nsummary(): `{todos: state.data.todos.length, ...}` map keys.\\n\\nsubscribe: array of fns; save() calls each.\\n\\nAlso expose `state`? Not directly; pages use CRUD + summary.\\n\\nOK writing files now. Also remember store needs `localStorage` guard for environments without it (try/catch).\\n\\nLet me now write all files. I\'ll do create_folder for css, js, js/pages in parallel; then create files (parallel where independent — all independent).\\n\\nFile 1: css/style.css\\n\\nLet me write it fully now (being careful about syntax).\\n\\nAlso: `.topbar-right{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }`.\\n\\nAlso add `.icon{ display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; flex-shrink:0; }` — svg.icon inherits width/height attrs; fine.\\n\\nFor `.nav-sub-item`: `display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:7px 12px; border-radius:8px; color:var(--text-2); font-size:.88rem; text-decoration:none; transition: all var(--t-fast) var(--ease); white-space:nowrap;` active: accent color + accent-soft bg; hover: text color.\\n\\n.dot: `width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;opacity:.45;`\\n\\nBadge: `.badge{ min-width:18px;height:18px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center; }` — used maybe in home quick buttons? not needed; keep anyway.\\n\\nProgress bar: `.progress{ height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ring-track);overflow:hidden; } .progress-bar{ height:100%;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent);transition:width 300ms var(--ease); }` — used in search? no; knowledge pages later. Keep.\\n\\nkv-row for about: `.kv-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:10px 20px; }`.\\n\\nOK — writing now for real. After that, verify.\\n\\nOne more app.js detail — `App.formatDate(isoStr)`: input \'YYYY-MM-DD\' or Date → \'8月3日 周一\' style: `formatDate(d, {withWeek:true})`. Keep simple: takes Date or \'YYYY-MM-DD\' string, returns \'YYYY年M月D日\' (+ optional 星期). For home date header: `2026年8月3日 星期一`.\\n\\nWeek names: [\'星期日\',\'星期一\',...].\\n\\nNow, home \\\"今日待办摘要\\\" list items: checkbox (native), title, prio dot. Click item → navigate(\'/work/todos\').\\n\\nRing: today\'s checkins sum durationMin vs goal 180. Show `${h}小时${m}分` and `${pct}%`. If no checkins → 0%.\\n\\nNote: textarea + mood chips [😊,😐,😤,😴] + save button; Enter in textarea (without shift) saves.\\n\\nBottom quick: 工作区/考公区/随笔区/搜索/设置 with icons.\\n\\nSearch page: input placeholder \'搜索待办、知识点、随笔…\'; tabs 全部/工作/考公/随笔; results; empty hint. Debounce 300ms. Mark highlight.\\n\\nNow writing. Let me get to it — many create_file calls.\\n\\nActually — file sizes: style.css maybe ~600-700 lines, app.js ~700-800 lines. That\'s fine.\\n\\nAlso — IMPORTANT subtlety about `contentEl.innerHTML = route.render()` — render may throw; wrap try/catch as planned.\\n\\nAnd about sidebar `.open` class toggling: default all groups open (set in HTML). When navigating, active group forced open. When sidebar collapsed, CSS hides subs.\\n\\nChevron button separate from head: structure:\\n\\n```html\\n<div class=\\\"nav-group\\\" data-group=\\\"/work\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"nav-group-row\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"nav-item nav-group-head\\\" data-path=\\\"/work\\\">\\n      <svg ...i-work/><span class=\\\"nav-text\\\">工作区</span>\\n    </button>\\n    <button class=\\\"nav-sub-toggle\\\" data-group=\\\"/work\\\" title=\\\"展开/折叠\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"icon chevron\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n    </button>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"nav-sub\\\"> ... </div>\\n</div>\\n```\\n\\nHmm — that complicates styles (row layout, toggle button width). Alternative simpler: head button includes chevron as last element and clicking head toggles subs; navigating to overview happens by... nothing (only toggle). Then how to reach /work? The chevron area vs head split: make head click toggle ONLY (not navigate), and add nav-text \\\"工作区\\\" clickable? Overcomplicating.\\n\\nSimplest robust choice: group head click → toggles sub-list (accordion). No overview navigation from sidebar — the sub items navigate to their pages; and the overview pages (/work etc.) exist as placeholders reachable via home quick buttons and search results. But sidebar 工作区 icon in collapsed mode: click → should navigate to \'/work\' (icon only, no subs visible). When collapsed, clicking head should navigate to overview. So: head click behavior: if sidebar collapsed → navigate(\'/work\'); else → toggle subs. That\'s intuitive! Implement in handler:\\n\\n```js\\ndelegate click on .nav-group-head: const collapsed = sidebar.classList.contains(\'collapsed\');\\nif (collapsed) App.navigate(dataset.path); else group.classList.toggle(\'open\');\\n```\\nAnd chevron is decorative (part of head). In collapsed mode chevron hidden. \\n\\nHmm but then in expanded mode, how to reach /work overview? Via home quick buttons / search results / future overview link. Acceptable. OR: head click navigate + a tiny chevron button toggles. I\'ll go with: expanded → click head toggles subs (chevron rotates); collapsed → click navigates to overview. Also double-click? no. Fine — clean.\\n\\nWait, also add: in expanded mode, maybe long-press/right-click? no. OK.\\n\\nActually, let me reconsider — users may expect clicking \\\"工作区\\\" text to go to 工作区总览. Design prompt: 工作区总览页 exists with entry cards. Sidebar in many apps: clicking section name goes to overview. I\'ll make head click navigate to overview ALWAYS, and the chevron a separate small toggle button:\\n\\n```html\\n<div class=\\\"nav-group\\\" data-group=\\\"/work\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"nav-group-row\\\">\\n    <button class=\\\"nav-item nav-group-head\\\" data-path=\\\"/work\\\" title=\\\"工作区总览\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"icon\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-work\\\"/></svg><span class=\\\"nav-text\\\">工作区</span>\\n    </button>\\n    <button class=\\\"nav-sub-toggle\\\" data-toggle-group=\\\"/work\\\" title=\\\"展开/折叠子项\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"icon chevron\\\"><use href=\\\"#i-chevron\\\"/></svg>\\n    </button>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"nav-sub\\\">...</div>\\n</div>\\n```\\n\\nCSS:\\n```css\\n.nav-group-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; }\\n.nav-group-row .nav-item{ flex:1; min-width:0; }\\n.nav-sub-toggle{ width:28px;height:28px;margin-right:6px; flex-shrink:0; display:grid;place-items:center; border:none;background:transparent;color:var(--text-3);border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition: all var(--t-fast) var(--ease); }\\n.nav-sub-toggle:hover{ background:var(--card-hover); color:var(--text); }\\n.nav-sub-toggle .chevron{ transition: transform 260ms var(--ease); }\\n.nav-group.open .nav-sub-toggle .chevron{ transform: rotate(180deg); }\\n.sidebar.collapsed .nav-sub-toggle{ display:none; }\\n```\\n\\nThis is clean and predictable. Go with it.\\n\\nHandler: `[data-toggle-group]` click → toggle group open. `.nav-group-head` data-path → navigate. \\n\\nActive group state: on route change, add .open to active group (if not collapsed).\\n\\nGood. Now finally write.\\n\\nAlso remember to give every nav element `title` attr for collapsed tooltip.\\n\\nTime to write the files. I\'ll write style.css now.\\n\\nAlso add small util classes: `.muted` (text-3), `.row`, `.gap-*`? skip.\\n\\nFor import preview modal content — build in JS with template string.\\n\\nAlso for the settings 导入 file input: `<input type=\\\"file\\\" id=\\\"file-import\\\" accept=\\\".json,application/json\\\" hidden>`.\\n\\nThe settings page HTML — let me write render():\\n\\n```js\\nrender(){\\n  const s = App.store.settings;\\n  const v = App.version;\\n  return `\\n  <div class=\\\"page\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"page-head\\\">\\n      <h2>设置</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"page-desc\\\">外观、数据管理与关于信息</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <section class=\\\"glass-card settings-group\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"settings-group-title\\\">外观</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">主题</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-desc\\\">亮色 / 暗色 / 跟随系统，实时生效</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"segmented\\\" id=\\\"theme-seg\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"seg-btn ${s.theme===\'light\'?\'active\':\'\'}\\\" data-mode=\\\"light\\\">${App.icon(\'sun\',15)}亮色</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"seg-btn ${s.theme===\'dark\'?\'active\':\'\'}\\\" data-mode=\\\"dark\\\">${App.icon(\'moon\',15)}暗色</button>\\n          <button class=\\\"seg-btn ${s.theme===\'system\'?\'active\':\'\'}\\\" data-mode=\\\"system\\\">${App.icon(\'monitor\',15)}跟随系统</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">字体大小</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-desc\\\" id=\\\"fs-value\\\">${s.fontSize}px</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <input type=\\\"range\\\" id=\\\"fs-range\\\" class=\\\"range\\\" min=\\\"13\\\" max=\\\"19\\\" step=\\\"1\\\" value=\\\"${s.fontSize}\\\">\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n    <section class=\\\"glass-card settings-group\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"settings-group-title\\\">数据管理</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">导出全部数据</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-desc\\\">导出为 JSON 文件，包含所有板块数据与设置</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" id=\\\"btn-export\\\">${App.icon(\'download\',16)}导出 JSON</button>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">导入数据</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-desc\\\">选择本应用导出的 JSON 文件，预览校验后导入</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" id=\\\"btn-import\\\">${App.icon(\'upload\',16)}选择文件</button>\\n        <input type=\\\"file\\\" id=\\\"file-import\\\" accept=\\\".json,application/json\\\" hidden>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">清空所有数据</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"setting-desc\\\">恢复为初始示例数据，需输入「我确定」确认</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn btn-danger\\\" id=\\\"btn-clear\\\">${App.icon(\'trash\',16)}清空数据</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n    <section class=\\\"glass-card settings-group\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"settings-group-title\\\">关于</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\"><div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">版本</div></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"tag tag-accent\\\">v${v}</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"setting-row\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"setting-label\\\"><div class=\\\"setting-name\\\">项目说明</div></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"setting-note\\\">「个人工作台」是一个纯本地运行的个人效率工具：工作区（待办 / 收件箱 / 项目 / 日志 / 会议）、考公区（知识点 / 题库 / 错题 / 计划 / 打卡 / 时政）与随笔区（随笔 / 灵感 / 复盘）。所有数据仅保存在当前浏览器的 localStorage 中，可通过「导出全部数据」随时备份或迁移，不上传任何服务器。</p>\\n    </section>\\n  </div>`;\\n}\\n```\\n\\nImport preview modal html:\\n```js\\nfunction importPreviewHtml(info){\\n  const rows = Object.entries(info.counts).map(([k,n])=>`<div class=\\\"import-row\\\"><span>${COLLECTION_LABELS[k]||k}</span><span class=\\\"import-count\\\">${n} 条</span></div>`).join(\'\');\\n  return `\\n    <div class=\\\"import-preview\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"import-meta\\\">\\n        <div><span class=\\\"muted\\\">来源文件：</span>${info.app||\'未知\'} · v${info.version||\'?\'}</div>\\n        <div><span class=\\\"muted\\\">导出时间：</span>${info.exportedAt?App.formatDate(info.exportedAt):\'未知\'}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"import-grid\\\">${rows}</div>\\n      <p class=\\\"import-warn muted\\\">导入将覆盖当前全部数据（含设置），且不可撤销。确认继续？</p>\\n    </div>`;\\n}\\n```\\n\\nCOLLECTION_LABELS in app.js: {todos:\'待办\', inbox:\'收件箱\', projects:\'项目\', logs:\'工作日志\', meetings:\'会议记录\', knowledge:\'知识点\', questions:\'题目\', wrongQuestions:\'错题\', plans:\'计划\', checkins:\'打卡记录\', shizheng:\'时政\', essays:\'随笔\', ideas:\'灵感\', reviews:\'复盘\'}.\\n\\nformatDate(iso): `new Date(iso)` — for exportedAt ISO with timezone, format \'YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm\'? Keep: return date part. I\'ll make formatDate accept Date|string and output `${y}年${m}月${d}日`; for exportedAt show that. Fine.\\n\\nAlright, writing files NOW. Let me also make sure about settings mount re-applying theme seg active states after import (settings re-rendered anyway).\\n\\nAlso: after clearAll — show toast; data resets; if settings kept, nothing else needed. But re-render current page for consistency: call WorkbenchRouter.render().\\n\\nLet me write all the files in sequence. First folders.\",\"content\":\"\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"I\'ve read the design prompt. Now let me plan the project structure: ``` D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\ ├── index.html ├── 工作台设计提示词.md (read-only, do not modify) ├── css/ │ └── style.css ├── js/ │ ├── store.js │ ├── router.js │ ├── app.js │ └…\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":2,\"round\":2,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":2,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:10:59');
