(1054, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 142826, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'skeleton', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"skeleton-turn-22\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Fixed. Now re-run the full browser check, plus add interaction-level checks. The headless dump can\'t click, but I can verify:\\n1. All pages render + no console errors (re-run).\\n2. window.App exists: I can check via dump? The dump shows DOM, not window state. I could inject a check by using --run-web-tests? No. Alternative: temporarily append a script that writes App contract info into the DOM? Can\'t modify index.html for testing.\\n\\nBetter: use Chrome DevTools Protocol? Too complex. Alternative: evaluate via a data: URL? No.\\n\\nSimplest: verify window.App exists by loading index.html with a query param and using a small temporary test harness: create a temp HTML file that loads the scripts in order and then writes `typeof window.App` + contract checks into document body; dump DOM of that temp file. That validates the contract exposure including registerPage/navigate/store/theme/exportJSON/showToast/openModal existence.\\n\\nAlso verify store persistence across reload (theme set → reload → data-theme dark in DOM). Headless with same user-data-dir across two runs: localStorage persists per origin within the profile dir. I can do: run1: open #/settings, but can\'t click. Hmm, can\'t click without CDP.\\n\\nAlternative for persistence check: use a temp harness HTML that calls App.theme.set(\'dark\') then document.title = \'THEME_APPLIED:\' + document.documentElement.dataset.theme; then a second page that reads it back. With same user-data-dir, localStorage persists. Then check second load has data-theme=dark (anti-flash script too). Good — validates theme persistence end-to-end.\\n\\nAlso test sidebar collapse: harness calls App.store.updateSettings({sidebarCollapsed:true}) and check sidebar class in next load? The boot applyShell applies class. Could check in same load after calling... applyShell is internal. Simpler: in harness, call App.theme.set + updateSettings then re-navigate? Let me just do the theme persistence test and window.App contract test. Sidebar collapse toggling is DOM-interaction (click) — the handler is straightforward; the CSS covers animation. I\'ll trust code review there, plus test applyShell indirectly: after updateSettings({sidebarCollapsed:true}), call location.reload? In headless dump-dom we can\'t easily reload within same run... Actually we CAN: harness page runs script that sets settings then `location.reload()`? dump-dom waits virtual time; reload would restart. Hmm, simpler: second temp page in same profile: it reads localStorage settings.sidebarCollapsed and writes result into body. That tests persistence, not applyShell. applyShell logic is trivial (classList.toggle). OK.\\n\\nLet me now:\\n1. Re-run browser checks (5 pages + console).\\n2. Temp harness for window.App contract + theme persistence + clearAll restore + import/export round trip (using App.exportJSON → store.importJSON round trip in browser).\\n\\nHarness HTML (in a temp folder under project? Must not pollute... I\'ll put in system temp dir. But scripts use relative paths js/store.js — so harness must reference absolute file paths: src=\\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/js/store.js\\\". Fine.)\\n\\nHarness:\\n```html\\n<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"></head><body>\\n<script src=\\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/js/store.js\\\"></script>\\n<script src=\\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/js/router.js\\\"></script>\\n<script src=\\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/js/app.js\\\"></script>\\n<script>\\nwindow.addEventListener(\'DOMContentLoaded\', function(){\\n  var out = [];\\n  var ok = function(c,m){ out.push((c?\'PASS\':\'FAIL\')+\': \'+m); };\\n  ok(typeof window.App === \'object\', \'window.App 存在\');\\n  ok(typeof App.registerPage === \'function\', \'App.registerPage 存在\');\\n  ok(typeof App.navigate === \'function\', \'App.navigate 存在\');\\n  ok(typeof App.refresh === \'function\', \'App.refresh 存在\');\\n  ok(App.store && typeof App.store.todos.add === \'function\', \'App.store 数据层可用\');\\n  ok(App.theme && typeof App.theme.set === \'function\' && typeof App.theme.apply === \'function\', \'App.theme 可用\');\\n  ok(App.fontSize && typeof App.fontSize.set === \'function\', \'App.fontSize 可用\');\\n  ok(typeof App.exportJSON === \'function\', \'App.exportJSON 存在\');\\n  ok(typeof App.showToast === \'function\', \'App.showToast 存在\');\\n  ok(typeof App.openModal === \'function\' && typeof App.closeModal === \'function\', \'App.openModal/closeModal 存在\');\\n  ok(typeof App.icon === \'function\' && App.icon(\'home\').indexOf(\'<svg\') === 0, \'App.icon 返回 SVG\');\\n  ok(typeof App.uid === \'function\' && typeof App.escapeHtml === \'function\', \'App.uid/escapeHtml 存在\');\\n  // 主题实时生效\\n  App.theme.set(\'dark\');\\n  ok(document.documentElement.dataset.theme === \'dark\', \'App.theme.set 实时生效 data-theme=dark\');\\n  // 字体\\n  App.fontSize.set(17);\\n  ok(document.documentElement.style.getPropertyValue(\'--fs-base\') === \'17px\', \'App.fontSize.set 写入 --fs-base\');\\n  // 导出→导入 往返\\n  var exported = App.store.exportJSON();\\n  ok(exported.data && exported.data.todos.length > 0, \'App.store.exportJSON 结构完整\');\\n  var imp = App.store.importJSON(JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(exported)));\\n  ok(imp.ok === true && App.store.todos.count() === exported.data.todos.length, \'导出→导入往返一致\');\\n  // 清空恢复\\n  App.store.clearAll();\\n  ok(App.store.todos.count() === 6, \'clearAll 恢复种子数据\');\\n  // 注册页面 & navigate（hash 路由生效）\\n  App.registerPage(\'/test-contract\', { title:\'契约测试页\', render:function(){ return \'<div id=\\\"contract-rendered\\\">CONTRACT_OK</div>\'; } });\\n  App.navigate(\'/test-contract\');\\n  setTimeout(function(){\\n    ok(document.getElementById(\'contract-rendered\') !== null, \'registerPage + navigate 渲染成功\');\\n    ok(document.getElementById(\'topbar-title\').textContent === \'契约测试页\', \'顶栏标题更新\');\\n    // 未注册路径 404\\n    App.navigate(\'/no-such-page-xyz\');\\n    setTimeout(function(){\\n      ok(document.querySelector(\'.not-found-code\') !== null, \'未注册路径显示 404\');\\n      document.body.setAttribute(\'data-result\', out.join(\'|\'));\\n      document.body.innerHTML = \'<pre>\' + out.join(\'\\\\n\') + \'</pre>\';\\n    }, 150);\\n  }, 150);\\n});\\n</script>\\n</body></html>\\n```\\n\\nWait — but app.js boot() runs on DOMContentLoaded and uses document.getElementById(\'sidebar\') etc. — those don\'t exist in the harness, but code handles nulls (initSidebar checks `if (!sidebar) return;`). Router setTargets with nulls — render checks contentEl. OK, safe. But note: boot also registers pages and calls render with contentEl=null → fine.\\n\\nThen dump this harness twice with the SAME user-data-dir to test persistence:\\n- Run A: harness sets theme dark + fontSize 17, then after, set body attribute and also mark \'PERSIST_MARK\'. But dump-dom happens at virtual time end; the innerHTML replacement happens in setTimeout 300ms — virtual-time-budget 3000 should cover.\\n- Run B (new page, same profile): a second harness that just reads App.store.settings and writes them — expect theme dark, fontSize 17.\\n\\nActually simpler: one harness that on first load sets and stores a flag in localStorage \'harness_done\'; the dump gives results; then second harness checks persisted settings. Two separate HTML files or same file with different behavior based on flag. Let me make harness read flag: if not set → do contract tests + set settings + set flag; if set → verify persisted settings are dark/17.\\n\\nThen final: verify topbar title & title updates, and dump results contain no FAIL.\\n\\nAlso re-run the earlier 5-page browser checks to confirm the /work placeholder now renders (with window.App fix).\\n\\nNote: the earlier check for /work placeholder failed only because of missing window.App. Let me redo everything in one comprehensive run.\\n\\nOne more thing to verify: exportJSON → real download can\'t be tested headless easily; but function exists and blob URL logic is standard. Skip.\\n\\nAlso the sidebar toggle click — could test via harness: document.getElementById(\'sidebar-toggle\').click() then check classList contains \'collapsed\'. In harness, sidebar doesn\'t exist (I didn\'t include it). I could include the full body? Too complex. Alternative: run harness from the actual index.html? I could load index.html and inject test via CDP — no. \\n\\nOption: temporary test copy of index.html with extra script appended before </body>. Since index.html loads all scripts, appending a test script at the end works: copy index.html to temp file, insert test script before </body>, load it with hash. The test script then can click sidebar toggle, check collapsed class, click topbar search button (navigates → hash change → search page), click settings gear, openModal, showToast, theme seg buttons, range input, clear modal input flow etc. That\'s a full E2E interaction test! Let me do that — it directly validates acceptance criteria:\\n\\n1. 侧边栏展开/收起：click #sidebar-toggle → sidebar.classList contains \'collapsed\' → click again → not collapsed.\\n2. 顶栏搜索入口：click #topbar-search-btn → location.hash === \'#/search\' and search page rendered.\\n3. 设置齿轮：click #topbar-settings-btn → \'#/settings\'.\\n4. 导航未注册 → 404.\\n5. 设置页主题切换：click [data-mode=\\\"dark\\\"] → data-theme=dark; [data-mode=\\\"light\\\"] → light.\\n6. 字体滑块：set value + dispatch input → --fs-base updated.\\n7. 导出：can\'t easily test download; check App.exportJSON defined and store export works (already covered).\\n8. 清空数据：click #btn-clear → modal appears → type 我确定 in #clear-confirm-input → confirm enabled → click confirm → todos count === 6 and toast appears.\\n9. Import: file input can\'t be set programmatically (security). Skip — validateImport covered in node tests.\\n\\nTest script does these sequentially with async waits, collecting PASS/FAIL into body data-result and innerHTML. Since the temp copy references relative css/js paths, it must live in the same directory (D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\) so relative paths resolve. I\'ll name it `_e2e_test.html` and delete after. The extra inline test script at end.\\n\\nCareful: the test script runs after DOMContentLoaded & boot (script at end of body executes after all previous scripts, and boot already ran since readyState !== \'loading\' when app.js\'s boot check runs? Actually app.js boot runs on DOMContentLoaded if loading, else immediately. Scripts at end of body run before DOMContentLoaded fires (DOMContentLoaded fires after parsing completes, which includes the test script). app.js boot: document.readyState at app.js execution time is \'loading\' (parser still going) → adds DOMContentLoaded listener → fires after test script? DOMContentLoaded fires when document parsed — the test script is part of parsing, so DOMContentLoaded fires AFTER test script executes. So boot runs after my test script! I must wait for DOMContentLoaded in the test script too. I\'ll wrap test in its own DOMContentLoaded listener — it will be called after boot\'s listener (registered earlier). Good.\\n\\nWait — but boot\'s render already ran on DOMContentLoaded. Then my test navigates. Fine.\\n\\nSequence with delays (~200ms each). Total < 3000ms virtual budget... might be tight. Use virtual-time-budget=8000. Each setTimeout in virtual time advances quickly. OK.\\n\\nAlso — localStorage state: each headless run uses fresh user-data-dir → seeds. Good.\\n\\nLet me write the E2E temp html by reading index.html and injecting script before `</body>`. I\'ll do it in Python: read index.html, find last \'</body>\', insert test script, write _e2e_test.html, run chrome dump, parse results, delete file.\\n\\nThe test script (inline, appended):\\n\\n```html\\n<script>\\n(function(){\\n  var results = [];\\n  function ok(c, m){ results.push((c?\'PASS\':\'FAIL\')+\': \'+m); }\\n  function wait(ms){ return new Promise(function(r){ setTimeout(r, ms); }); }\\n  (async function(){\\n    try {\\n      // 1. 侧边栏折叠/展开\\n      var sb = document.getElementById(\'sidebar\');\\n      ok(!!sb, \'侧边栏容器存在\');\\n      var st = document.getElementById(\'sidebar-toggle\');\\n      st.click();\\n      await wait(250);\\n      ok(sb.classList.contains(\'collapsed\'), \'点击折叠按钮后侧边栏收起\');\\n      st.click();\\n      await wait(250);\\n      ok(!sb.classList.contains(\'collapsed\'), \'再次点击后侧边栏展开\');\\n\\n      // 2. 顶栏搜索入口\\n      document.getElementById(\'topbar-search-btn\').click();\\n      await wait(300);\\n      ok(location.hash === \'#/search\' || location.hash === \'#search\', \'顶栏搜索入口跳转 #/search，当前=\' + location.hash);\\n      ok(!!document.getElementById(\'search-input\'), \'搜索页已渲染\');\\n\\n      // 3. 顶栏设置齿轮\\n      document.getElementById(\'topbar-settings-btn\').click();\\n      await wait(300);\\n      ok(location.hash.indexOf(\'settings\') >= 0, \'顶栏设置齿轮跳转设置页，当前=\' + location.hash);\\n\\n      // 4. 设置页主题切换\\n      var darkBtn = document.querySelector(\'#theme-seg .seg-btn[data-mode=\\\"dark\\\"]\');\\n      darkBtn.click();\\n      await wait(200);\\n      ok(document.documentElement.dataset.theme === \'dark\', \'切换暗色主题生效 data-theme=dark\');\\n\\n      // 5. 字体滑块\\n      var range = document.getElementById(\'fs-range\');\\n      range.value = \'19\';\\n      range.dispatchEvent(new Event(\'input\', { bubbles: true }));\\n      ok(document.documentElement.style.getPropertyValue(\'--fs-base\') === \'19px\', \'字体滑块写入 --fs-base=19px\');\\n      ok(document.getElementById(\'fs-value\').textContent === \'19px\', \'字体大小显示更新\');\\n\\n      // 6. 侧边栏导航到未注册路径 → 404\\n      App.navigate(\'/some/unregistered\');\\n      await wait(300);\\n      ok(!!document.querySelector(\'.not-found-code\'), \'未注册路径显示 404\');\\n      ok(document.getElementById(\'topbar-title\').textContent === \'页面不存在\', \'404 顶栏标题正确\');\\n\\n      // 7. 清空数据流程（输入「我确定」）\\n      App.navigate(\'/settings\');\\n      await wait(300);\\n      document.getElementById(\'btn-clear\').click();\\n      await wait(300);\\n      var mask = document.querySelector(\'.modal-mask\');\\n      ok(!!mask, \'清空数据弹出确认弹窗\');\\n      var confirmBtn = mask.querySelector(\'.modal-confirm\');\\n      ok(confirmBtn.disabled === true, \'未输入确认文字时确认按钮禁用\');\\n      var input = mask.querySelector(\'#clear-confirm-input\');\\n      input.value = \'我确定\';\\n      input.dispatchEvent(new Event(\'input\', { bubbles: true }));\\n      ok(confirmBtn.disabled === false, \'输入「我确定」后确认按钮可用\');\\n      confirmBtn.click();\\n      await wait(400);\\n      ok(App.store.todos.count() === 6, \'确认后数据恢复为初始示例（todos=6）\');\\n      ok(!!document.querySelector(\'.toast\'), \'清空后出现 Toast 提示\');\\n\\n      // 8. 设置页分组结构\\n      ok(document.querySelectorAll(\'.settings-group\').length === 3, \'设置页三个分组（外观/数据/关于）\');\\n\\n      // 9. 侧边栏导航到工作区占位页\\n      App.navigate(\'/work\');\\n      await wait(300);\\n      ok(document.querySelector(\'.section-placeholder\') !== null, \'工作区占位页渲染\');\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      results.push(\'FAIL: 异常 \' + e.message);\\n    }\\n    document.body.setAttribute(\'data-result\', results.join(\'|\'));\\n    document.body.innerHTML = \'<pre id=\\\"e2e-output\\\">\' + results.join(\'\\\\n\') + \'</pre>\';\\n  })();\\n})();\\n</script>\\n```\\n\\nThen check output contains no \'FAIL\' and \'PASS\' count = expected.\\n\\nNote step 2: location.hash — navigate sets location.hash = \'#/search\'. Good.\\n\\nFor step 7 toast: toast has animation 2200ms + auto-remove after 2600ms; check within 400ms — ok.\\n\\nAlso modal closeOnMask false for clear — fine.\\n\\nOne risk: `App` — after fix, window.App exists. Good.\\n\\nAlso the inline script references App — loaded after all scripts.\\n\\nLet me run this comprehensive E2E now, plus re-run the page-render checks for /work placeholder.\",\"content\":\"修复完成。现在做综合浏览器 E2E 验证——先重跑页面渲染检查，再基于 index.html 副本注入交互测试脚本（点击折叠按钮、搜索入口、设置齿轮、主题切换、字体滑块、404、清空数据全流程）：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"修复完成。现在做综合浏览器 E2E 验证——先重跑页面渲染检查，再基于 index.html 副本注入交互测试脚本（点击折叠按钮、搜索入口、设置齿轮、主题切换、字体滑块、404、清空数据全流程）：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":22,\"round\":22,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":22,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:45:03'),
(1055, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 142827, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_work-turn-22\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"文件完整（2304 行，117KB）。之前 grep 报错是工具路径解析问题（可能因为反斜杠）。现在用 edit_file 修复三个问题。\\n\\n修复 1：bindLongPress firedAt 初始值。找到位置：\\n`var timer = null, sx = 0, sy = 0, firedAt = 0;`\\n\\n修复 2：detail 页 file input 移到页面根部。找到 render 中 files panel 的 input 行和页面结尾。\\n\\n修复 3：Tab 切换局部更新。需要重构 projectDetail 的 render 与 mount。\\n\\n先做修复 1 和 2（简单），再重构 tab（修复 3）。\\n\\n修复 1：\\nold: `var timer = null, sx = 0, sy = 0, firedAt = 0;`\\nnew: `var timer = null, sx = 0, sy = 0, firedAt = -1e12;`\\n\\n修复 2：\\ndetail render 中 files panel:\\n```\\n          }).join(\'\') : \'<div class=\\\"empty-state\\\"><p>暂无附件，点下方「+ 添加文件」上传记录</p></div>\') +\\n          \'<input type=\\\"file\\\" class=\\\"work-file-input\\\" data-act=\\\"file-input\\\">\' +\\n          \'</div>\';\\n```\\n改为：\\n```\\n          }).join(\'\') : \'<div class=\\\"empty-state\\\"><p>暂无附件，点下方「+ 添加文件」上传记录</p></div>\') +\\n          \'</div>\';\\n```\\n然后在页面根（work-fab 之后）加 input：\\n```\\n        \'<div class=\\\"work-fab\\\">\' + ... \'</div></div>\';\\n```\\n改为：\\n```\\n        \'<div class=\\\"work-fab\\\">\' + ... \'</div>\' +\\n        \'<input type=\\\"file\\\" class=\\\"work-file-input\\\" data-act=\\\"file-input\\\">\' +\\n        \'</div>\';\\n```\\n\\n修复 3：Tab 切换滑动动画。\\n当前 render 里有：\\n```js\\nvar tabsHtml = \'<div class=\\\"work-tabs\\\" data-act=\\\"tabs\\\">\' + ...\\nvar panelHtml = \'\'; if (tab === \'tasks\') {...} else if notes ... else files ...\\n```\\n我需要抽出 detailPanelHtml(id, tab) 函数，并在 mount 的 tab 点击处理里局部更新。\\n\\n步骤：\\na) 新增函数 `function detailPanelHtml(id, tab) {...}` 包含当前 render 里的 panel 逻辑（tasks/notes/files 分支）。\\nb) render 里用 `var panelHtml = detailPanelHtml(id, tab);`。\\nc) mount 的 onClick tab 分支改为局部更新。\\n\\n让我先 view 相关代码段，精确提取。\",\"content\":\"文件完整（2304 行）。现在逐一修复。先查看详情页 render 与 tab 相关代码段：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"文件完整（2304 行）。现在逐一修复。先查看详情页 render 与 tab 相关代码段：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":22,\"round\":22,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":22,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:45:03'),
(1056, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 142828, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-22\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"\",\"content\":\"\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":22,\"round\":22,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":22,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:45:03'),
(1057, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 142829, 'tool.started', 'code', 'moonya', 'skeleton', 'call_00_TZzgSOj7t9l13dCbPprp2954', '{\"tool_key\":\"python_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Python 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"code\":\"import subprocess, os, tempfile, shutil\\n\\nchrome = r\\\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\\\"\\nbase = r\\\"D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\"\\nindex = \\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html\\\"\\n\\ndef dump(url, tag, budget=3000):\\n    user_data = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\\\"chrome_headless_\\\")\\n    try:\\n        r = subprocess.run(\\n            [chrome, \\\"--headless\\\", \\\"--disable-gpu\\\", \\\"--no-sandbox\\\", \\\"--disable-extensions\\\",\\n             \\\"--user-data-dir=\\\" + user_data, \\\"--enable-logging=stderr\\\", \\\"--v=0\\\",\\n             \\\"--virtual-time-budget=\\\" + str(budget), \\\"--dump-dom\\\", url],\\n            capture_output=True, text=True, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", errors=\\\"replace\\\",\\n            timeout=120, cwd=base)\\n        return r.stdout, r.stderr\\n    finally:\\n        shutil.rmtree(user_data, ignore_errors=True)\\n\\ndef check(name, html, must_have):\\n    ok = True\\n    for m in must_have:\\n        if m not in html:\\n            print(f\\\"[{name}] 缺失: {m}\\\"); ok = False\\n    print(f\\\"[{name}] {\'PASS\' if ok else \'FAIL\'}\\\")\\n    return ok\\n\\ndef check_console(name, stderr):\\n    errs = [l for l in stderr.splitlines() if \\\"CONSOLE\\\" in l and \\\"ERROR\\\" in l]\\n    if errs:\\n        for e in errs[:15]: print(f\\\"[{name}] 控制台错误: {e.strip()[:250]}\\\")\\n        return False\\n    print(f\\\"[{name}] 控制台无错误 PASS\\\")\\n    return True\\n\\nall_ok = True\\n\\n# 页面渲染 + 控制台检查（含修复后的 /work 占位页）\\nfor tag, frag, must in [\\n    (\\\"首页\\\", \\\"\\\", [\\\"今日待办摘要\\\", \\\"学习打卡\\\", \\\"随笔速记\\\", \\\"开始打卡\\\", \\\"id=\\\\\\\"sidebar\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"id=\\\\\\\"topbar\\\\\\\"\\\", \\\"id=\\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\"\\\"]),\\n    (\\\"设置页\\\", \\\"#/settings\\\", [\\\"外观\\\", \\\"数据管理\\\", \\\"关于\\\", \\\"导出全部数据\\\", \\\"导入数据\\\", \\\"清空所有数据\\\", \\\"我确定\\\", \\\"跟随系统\\\"]),\\n    (\\\"搜索页\\\", \\\"#/search\\\", [\\\"搜索\\\", \\\"全部\\\", \\\"考公\\\", \\\"输入关键词开始搜索\\\"]),\\n    (\\\"404页\\\", \\\"#/work/todos-unknown\\\", [\\\"404\\\", \\\"页面不存在\\\", \\\"尚未注册\\\", \\\"返回首页\\\"]),\\n    (\\\"工作区占位\\\", \\\"#/work\\\", [\\\"工作区\\\", \\\"将在后续任务中实现\\\"]),\\n    (\\\"考公区占位\\\", \\\"#/study\\\", [\\\"考公区\\\", \\\"将在后续任务中实现\\\"]),\\n    (\\\"随笔区占位\\\", \\\"#/personal\\\", [\\\"随笔区\\\", \\\"将在后续任务中实现\\\"]),\\n]:\\n    out, err = dump(index + frag, tag)\\n    all_ok &= check(tag, out, must)\\n    all_ok &= check_console(tag, err)\\n\\nprint(\\\"\\\\n总体:\\\", \\\"ALL_PAGE_CHECKS_PASS\\\" if all_ok else \\\"HAS_FAILURES\\\")\\n\"},\"effect\":\"write\",\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"phase\":null,\"operation_id\":null,\"intent\":null,\"shell\":null,\"command_fingerprint\":null}', '2026-08-03 13:45:03');
