(1075, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 144961, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-23\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Three failures:\\n\\n1. `/study/knowledge/seed-know-1: 未注册` and `/study/knowledge/nonexistent: 未注册` — these are EXPECTED: my harness2 only has knowledge k1/k2/k3, not seed-know-1. ensureKnowledgeRoutes registers \'/study/knowledge/k1\' etc. (which exist in harness2\'s store), not seed-know-1. My test cases were wrong — they reference seed ids that don\'t exist in harness2 store. This is a test bug, not code bug. The harness2 test expects \'/study/knowledge/seed-know-1\' registered but store has k1/k2/k3. Fix test: use k1/k2 and for nonexistent path, render should still work via... hmm — \'/study/knowledge/nonexistent\' isn\'t registered (correctly) — the detail page for unknown ids is only reachable via literal \':id\' route or registered routes. In the browser, an unregistered hash → 404. That\'s expected behavior for nonexistent knowledge. So the test case should not require registration; instead I should test rendering via the literal \'/study/knowledge/:id\' route definition with a nonexistent id, or via the k1 route.\\n\\nFix test cases:\\n- [\'/study/knowledge/k1\', \'/study/knowledge/k1\'] — registered ✓\\n- [\'/study/knowledge/k2\', \'/study/knowledge/k2\'] — registered ✓\\n- nonexistent: render via def = registered[\'/study/knowledge/:id\'] with path \'/study/knowledge/nonexistent\' → expects not-found UI (fine).\\n- \':id\' literal: def = registered[\'/study/knowledge/:id\'] with path \'/study/knowledge/:id\' → id=\':id\' → not found branch. OK.\\n\\n2. `题库 render 未包含新增题` — hmm! questions.add works (count check passed since no failure reported for that). But render didn\'t include \'新增题\'. Why? QUESTIONS_DEF.render builds module/tag/source option lists and the list is rendered in mount (listBox) — render() itself only renders the filter bar + empty list container! The card list is rendered in mount via renderList(). So the render output won\'t contain \'新增题\'. My test expectation is wrong — the question list is populated at mount. So this test failure is a test design issue. \\n\\nI could improve: make the test call mount? Too complex without DOM. Instead, assert render output contains \'st-q-list\' (already) and skip content assertion. Or I can verify data flow via store count assertion (already passing). Adjust test: drop the \'新增题\' render assertion; assert store count grew.\\n\\nWait — but is there a real UX concern? The list only renders at mount — yes, that\'s the design (render returns container, mount populates). Fine.\\n\\nActually, hold on — one real consideration: since render() doesn\'t include the question list, direct hash entry renders the page with an empty list, then mount fills it — that works because mount runs right after render. OK.\\n\\nAlso check the wrong-stats assertion passed? No failure reported for it — good (though the assertion was weak: `wHtml.indexOf(\'>1<\')` — stats are `>1<`? Actually stats render `<span class=\\\"num\\\">1</span>` for pending (w1 pending=1) → \'>1<\' present. Fine.)\\n\\nLet me fix harness2 test cases and re-run. These are test bugs, not product bugs — I must NOT modify study.js for these. Per protocol: only fix the verification, never redo the successful act. The act here is the test run — it failed due to test bugs; fixing the test file is legitimate.\\n\\nUpdate harness2:\\n- cases: replace seed-know-1 with k1 (registered), remove \'nonexistent\' from cases (test via :id def instead), keep \':id\' case but route lookup: def = registered[\'/study/knowledge/:id\'].\\n- The nonexistent render: use defOf(\':id\') with path \'/study/knowledge/nonexistent\' → expect \'未找到该知识点\'.\\n- Remove \'题库 render 未包含新增题\' assertion; instead assert store.questions.count() === 3 after add, and that a second render includes the option lists? No — keep store assertion.\\n\\nLet me edit harness2.\",\"content\":\"三处失败均为**测试用例设计问题**，非产品代码缺陷：\\n1. `seed-know-1`/`nonexistent` 在 harness2 的 store 中不存在（动态路由只注册真实存在的 id）——测试用例应改用 k1/k2，不存在 id 走字面量 `:id` 路由渲染\\\"未找到\\\"分支；\\n2. 题库题目列表由 `mount` 填充（render 只输出容器），`新增题` 断言应改为校验 store 数据流。\\n\\n修正测试文件后重跑。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"三处失败均为**测试用例设计问题**，非产品代码缺陷： 1. `seed-know-1`/`nonexistent` 在 harness2 的 store 中不存在（动态路由只注册真实存在的 id）——测试用例应改用 k1/k2，不存在 id 走字面量 `:id` 路由渲染\\\"未找到\\\"分支； 2. 题库题目列表由 `mount` 填充（render 只输出容器），`新增题` 断言应改为校验 store 数据流。 修正测试文件后重跑。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":23,\"round\":23,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":23,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:45:48'),
(1076, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 144962, 'tool.started', 'code', 'moonya', 'skeleton', 'call_00_FEwCC3oT2cfglLa3N4Gs3687', '{\"tool_key\":\"python_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Python 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"code\":\"import subprocess, os, tempfile, shutil, re\\n\\nchrome = r\\\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\\\"\\nbase = r\\\"D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\"\\n\\ndef dump(url):\\n    user_data = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\\\"chrome_headless_\\\")\\n    try:\\n        r = subprocess.run(\\n            [chrome, \\\"--headless\\\", \\\"--disable-gpu\\\", \\\"--no-sandbox\\\", \\\"--disable-extensions\\\",\\n             \\\"--user-data-dir=\\\" + user_data, \\\"--enable-logging=stderr\\\", \\\"--v=0\\\",\\n             \\\"--virtual-time-budget=3000\\\", \\\"--dump-dom\\\", url],\\n            capture_output=True, text=True, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", errors=\\\"replace\\\",\\n            timeout=120, cwd=base)\\n        return r.stdout\\n    finally:\\n        shutil.rmtree(user_data, ignore_errors=True)\\n\\nindex = \\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html\\\"\\n\\nfor frag in [\\\"#/work\\\", \\\"#/study\\\", \\\"#/personal\\\"]:\\n    out = dump(index + frag)\\n    # 提取 <main class=\\\"content\\\"> 的内容\\n    m = re.search(r\'<main class=\\\"content\\\"[^>]*>(.*?)</main>\', out, re.S)\\n    body = m.group(1) if m else \\\"(未找到 content)\\\"\\n    body = re.sub(r\'\\\\s+\', \' \', body)[:400]\\n    print(f\\\"===== {frag} content 内容 =====\\\")\\n    print(body)\\n    print()\\n\"},\"effect\":\"write\",\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"phase\":null,\"operation_id\":null,\"intent\":null,\"shell\":null,\"command_fingerprint\":null}', '2026-08-03 13:45:48'),
