(1091, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 145497, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'skeleton', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"skeleton-turn-24\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Very interesting findings:\\n\\n1. `#/work` → 404 \\\"路径「/work」尚未注册\\\" — so work.js did NOT register \'/work\'.\\n2. `#/study` → RENDERS a REAL study page! \\\"考公区 学习概况与六大功能入口 st-stats st-roll...\\\" — this is NOT my placeholder! Someone else\'s study.js content?? The page has classes like `st-page`, `st-stat-card`, `st-roll` — these are NOT in my placeholder file!\\n\\nWait... this means ANOTHER task (parallel task) has already created its own study.js?! The task description said \\\"所有页面模块文件（work.js/study.js/personal.js）由后续任务并行创建\\\" — parallel tasks might be running concurrently and writing to the same files! The study.js I created was overwritten by another task\'s study.js which registers \'/study\' with a real page!\\n\\nLet me check the current contents of js/pages/ files and the file modification times. The personal.js still shows MY placeholder. So the parallel task has written study.js (and maybe work.js?) — but /work shows 404, meaning work.js doesn\'t register \'/work\'... OR work.js was overwritten with something that doesn\'t register \'/work\'?\\n\\nLet me look at the current files.\",\"content\":\"关键发现：`#/study` 渲染的是**另一个并行任务已写入的真实考公区页面**（st-page/st-roll 等类名非我创建），而 `#/work` 是 404——说明并行任务正在实时覆盖页面模块文件。先查看当前文件状态：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"关键发现：`#/study` 渲染的是**另一个并行任务已写入的真实考公区页面**（st-page/st-roll 等类名非我创建），而 `#/work` 是 404——说明并行任务正在实时覆盖页面模块文件。先查看当前文件状态：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":24,\"round\":24,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":24,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:46:37'),
