(1108, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 146616, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'skeleton', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"skeleton-turn-25\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Confirmed: work.js (117KB, 21:38) and study.js (111KB, 21:40) have been overwritten by parallel tasks with full implementations. personal.js (1736 bytes, 21:19) is still my placeholder.\\n\\nSo the parallel tasks are actively writing. The situation:\\n- work.js: full implementation, registered pages presumably including \'/work\'... but the dump showed \'/work\' → 404! That\'s odd. Let me check what paths work.js registers. Maybe they register \'/work/todos\' etc. but NOT \'/work\'? Let me grep registered paths in work.js and study.js.\\n\\nAlso note my earlier browser checks ran at different times — the files were being written concurrently, so results were inconsistent (earlier run had study placeholder... actually no, earlier runs: study failed \\\"考公区 将在后续任务中实现\\\" — because at that time study.js was already the full version without that text; work failed similarly).\\n\\nNow the concern for MY deliverable:\\n1. The skeleton contract (App) must remain compatible with these page modules. They\'re written against my contract (they use App.* — presumably). Let me verify they only use documented APIs: App.registerPage, App.store, App.icon, App.navigate, App.showToast, App.openModal, App.uid, App.escapeHtml, App.formatDate, App.theme, App.fontSize, App.refresh... Let me grep for `App\\\\.` usages to ensure no undefined API is used.\\n\\n2. store.js — did the parallel tasks extend store.js? My store.js is 20547 bytes at 21:36:57 — I wrote it ~21:15, then edited at ~21:36 (the settings getter fix was written then). Length 20547 — but did a parallel task modify it? The edit I made was small (settings getter). 20547 bytes seems right for my file with seed data. But wait — did a parallel task also modify store.js (e.g., adding fields needed by their pages)? If they changed it after my fix, there could be conflicts. Let me check if my fix is still in store.js and whether extra stuff was added.\\n\\n3. app.js is mine (38323, 21:44 — that\'s after my window.App fix at 21:44). Good.\\n\\n4. Check that work.js/study.js don\'t error in console (they rendered /study fine). Check /work — 404 means work.js doesn\'t register \'/work\'. Let me check what it registers — maybe they only register sub-pages and \'/work\' overview is missing, or they use a different path. That\'s THEIR task\'s concern, not mine — but if work.js has a bug (e.g., missing \'/work\'), that\'s their responsibility. My skeleton shouldn\'t fix their files... but hmm, wait — maybe their work.js registers \'/work\' but the file was mid-write when I dumped (21:38 modified, dump happened ~21:44+). Let me re-dump now and grep their registrations.\\n\\nActually, my earlier concern: work.js at 21:38:55 — the dump ran later. Let me check what paths work.js registers right now and re-test /work.\\n\\nAlso important: verify their pages don\'t depend on APIs I didn\'t provide (contract violations would show as console errors — earlier console checks showed NO errors on /study and /work 404 pages... but console errors only occur when the code path executes. If their page calls App.xxx that\'s undefined, it\'d throw on mount — visible in console. /study rendered with st-stats etc. and no console errors → they use my contract fine).\\n\\nLet me grep App. usage in work.js/study.js to confirm API compatibility, and check registered paths. Also re-check /work now (maybe mid-write earlier).\",\"content\":\"并行任务已写入完整版 work.js（117KB）和 study.js（111KB），personal.js 仍是我的占位。现在核对并行模块与我契约的兼容性——检查它们使用的 App API 与注册路径：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"并行任务已写入完整版 work.js（117KB）和 study.js（111KB），personal.js 仍是我的占位。现在核对并行模块与我契约的兼容性——检查它们使用的 App API 与注册路径：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":25,\"round\":25,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":25,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:47:25'),
(1109, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 146617, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_work-turn-25\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"修复 1 完成。现在修复 2+3：重构详情页 render 的 panel 生成逻辑为独立函数 + 文件 input 移到根部 + Tab 局部切换。\\n\\n修改 A：把 render 中的 panelHtml 生成块（1561-1604）替换为调用 detailPanelHtml 函数，并将该函数定义放到 DETAIL_TABS 之后。\\n\\n修改 B：files panel 中删除 input 行；页面根部加 input。\\n\\n修改 C：mount tab 点击局部更新。\\n\\n先替换 render 的 panel 部分。原文（1561-1604 行，但行号可能已变化，用内容匹配）：\\n\\n从 `      var panelHtml = \'\';` 到 `      }` （1604 行结束 `      }`）—— 我改用精确的 old_str（从 `var panelHtml = \'\';` 到 files 分支结尾）。\",\"content\":\"修复 2+3：抽取 panel 生成函数、文件 input 移出面板、Tab 切换局部更新（保留下划线滑动动画）：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"修复 2+3：抽取 panel 生成函数、文件 input 移出面板、Tab 切换局部更新（保留下划线滑动动画）：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":25,\"round\":25,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":25,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:47:25'),
