(1132, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 147004, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'skeleton', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"skeleton-turn-26\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Good news: work.js registers \'/work\' too (line 2246). So the earlier 404 for \'/work\' was because the file was mid-write when dumped (21:38 write, my dump may have hit partial file, or... actually the 404 was at 21:44+ — hmm, work.js modified 21:38:55 and dump was after. But maybe their file had a syntax error at that moment, or the IIFE registration failed. Or... let me just re-test now.\\n\\nThe negative lookahead grep failed (ripgrep doesn\'t support lookahead). Let me extract all `App.` member usages from the pages with a simpler approach — grep for `App\\\\.[a-zA-Z]+` and then compare against known API list manually.\",\"content\":\"work.js 也注册了 \'/work\'（第 2246 行）——之前 404 可能是文件写入中途导致。提取并行模块使用的全部 App API 清单核对契约兼容性：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"work.js 也注册了 \'/work\'（第 2246 行）——之前 404 可能是文件写入中途导致。提取并行模块使用的全部 App API 清单核对契约兼容性：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":26,\"round\":26,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":26,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:48:01'),
(1133, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 147005, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_work-turn-26\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"现在添加 detailPanelHtml 函数（在 DETAIL_TABS 定义之后），并修改 mount 的 tab 点击为局部更新。\\n\\ndetailPanelHtml 函数定义插入在 `var projectDetail = {` 之前。\",\"content\":\"现在插入 `detailPanelHtml` 函数（在 projectDetail 定义前）：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"现在插入 `detailPanelHtml` 函数（在 projectDetail 定义前）：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":26,\"round\":26,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":26,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:48:01'),
(1134, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 147006, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-26\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"All render smoke tests pass. Now I want to test mount-level interactions with a real DOM. Check if jsdom is available. If not, I can write a minimal DOM implementation... that\'s a big effort. Let me check jsdom availability first.\",\"content\":\"渲染冒烟全部通过。再检查 jsdom 是否可用，以进行 mount 交互级测试。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"渲染冒烟全部通过。再检查 jsdom 是否可用，以进行 mount 交互级测试。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":26,\"round\":26,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":26,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 13:48:01'),
