(1285, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 163189, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_work-turn-36\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"两处修复完成。现在做最终验证：\\n1. node --check 语法\\n2. 冒烟测试重跑（确认修复没破坏）\\n3. 检查其他骨架文件语法（store.js/router.js/app.js）确保整个应用可加载\\n\\n另外，我应该考虑用真实的浏览器环境测试。有 Playwright/Puppeteer 吗？可能没有。试试检查一下是否安装了 playwright/puppeteer。如果没有，用 node vm 冒烟测试已经覆盖主要逻辑。\\n\\n还有一个重要检查：**验证 index.html 页面加载时不会因为 work.js 与其他并行任务的文件（study.js/personal.js）冲突**。study.js/personal.js 是并行任务生成的，它们可能注册 \'/study/*\' 等路径——与我的不冲突。但**它们可能也注册 \'*\' 覆盖 404**！如果 study.js 或 personal.js 注册了 \'*\'，不影响我的动态路由（我的方案不依赖 \'*\'）。✓ 我的方案很稳。\\n\\n再检查一下并行任务是否还在写 work.js（之前被覆盖过一次）。现在文件修改时间应该是我最后 edit 的时间。让我确认文件未被再次覆盖。\\n\\n执行最终验证。\",\"content\":\"修复完成。执行最终验证：语法检查 + 冒烟测试重跑 + 确认文件未被并行任务覆盖：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"修复完成。执行最终验证：语法检查 + 冒烟测试重跑 + 确认文件未被并行任务覆盖：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":36,\"round\":36,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":36,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:05:53'),
(1286, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 163190, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-36\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Project directory is clean (no node_modules, no package.json). Good. So where did npm install? The sandbox may have redirected the cwd. The `study-jsdom` temp dir is empty. npm must have installed somewhere — maybe the executor runs each command in a fresh shell whose cwd is the project, and `cd /d` + `&&` chain… but the dir was created (mkdir worked? the dir exists but is empty — mkdir succeeded). Then `cd /d` succeeded, npm install ran with cwd = study-jsdom... but dir is empty?!\\n\\nWait — maybe npm installed with a prefix elsewhere, or the sandbox redirects writes to a virtual overlay? Or the \\\"removed 9 packages\\\" suggests npm modified an existing node_modules — maybe npm resolved to a different directory (e.g., npm config prefix, or it walked up and found a node_modules at some parent: C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\node_modules? C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\node_modules?).\\n\\nLet me search for jsdom\'s package.json under likely locations: $env:APPDATA\\\\npm\\\\node_modules, C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\node_modules, and C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\node_modules. Use a bounded search via PowerShell. Also check npm root -g and npm config get prefix.\",\"content\":\"项目目录干净（未污染）。npm 似乎装到了其他位置，定位一下。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"项目目录干净（未污染）。npm 似乎装到了其他位置，定位一下。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":36,\"round\":36,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":36,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:05:53'),
(1287, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 163191, 'tool.started', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', 'call_00_ycs4I5fusu1BX9ZQUyHy6774', '{\"tool_key\":\"python_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Python 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"code\":\"import subprocess, os\\n\\nnode = r\'D:\\\\nodejs\\\\node.exe\'\\nwork = r\'D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\js\\\\pages\\\\work.js\'\\n\\n# 1. 语法检查 work.js + 骨架 js\\nprint(\'=== 语法检查 ===\')\\nfor f in [work, r\'D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\js\\\\store.js\', r\'D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\js\\\\router.js\', r\'D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\js\\\\app.js\']:\\n    if not os.path.exists(f):\\n        print(\'MISSING:\', f)\\n        continue\\n    r = subprocess.run([node, \'--check\', f], capture_output=True, text=True)\\n    print(os.path.basename(f), \'->\', \'OK\' if r.returncode == 0 else \'SYNTAX ERROR: \' + r.stderr[:300])\\n\\n# 2. 文件元信息\\nst = os.stat(work)\\nprint(\'\\\\nwork.js size:\', st.st_size, \'modified:\', st.st_mtime)\\nprint(\'exists pages:\', os.listdir(r\'D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\ccee\\\\web1\\\\js\\\\pages\'))\\n\\n# 3. 重跑冒烟测试\\ntest_path = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\'TEMP\', \'.\'), \'work_smoke_test3.js\')\\nif os.path.exists(test_path):\\n    r = subprocess.run([node, test_path], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=60)\\n    print(\'\\\\n=== 冒烟测试（重跑） ===\')\\n    out = r.stdout[-2500:]\\n    print(out)\\n    print(\'exit:\', r.returncode)\\nelse:\\n    print(\'test script missing, skip\')\\n\"},\"effect\":\"write\",\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"phase\":null,\"operation_id\":null,\"intent\":null,\"shell\":null,\"command_fingerprint\":null}', '2026-08-03 14:05:53'),
