(1307, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 164233, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_work-turn-38\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"有 Chrome/Edge 但无 puppeteer/playwright。我可以直接用 Chrome headless + `--dump-dom` 来做端到端验证：用 `chrome --headless --dump-dom \\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html#/work\\\"`，它会加载页面、执行 JS、输出最终 DOM。\\n\\n这能验证：\\n1. 页面能否加载（无 JS 崩溃）\\n2. hash 路由渲染结果（#/work 等）\\n\\n用 --dump-dom 对每个 hash 路径运行，检查输出 HTML 包含预期内容。注意 localStorage 在 headless 下每次全新（--user-data-dir 临时目录可持久化）。\\n\\n还可以用 --virtual-time-budget 让异步任务完成。\\n\\n命令示例：\\n```\\nchrome.exe --headless=new --disable-gpu --dump-dom --virtual-time-budget=3000 \\\"file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html#/work\\\"\\n```\\n输出 DOM 到 stdout。检查其中是否包含 work-overview 内容。\\n\\n对每个路径跑一遍：\\n- #/work → work-overview、今日待办\\n- #/work/todos → work-todos、重要紧急\\n- #/work/inbox → work-inbox、未清理\\n- #/work/projects → work-projects、新建项目\\n- #/work/projects/seed-proj-1 → 项目详情（产品 3.0 改版）\\n- #/work/log → work-log、生成周报\\n- #/work/meetings → work-meetings、新建会议记录\\n\\n注意：--dump-dom 的 stdout 可能是整个 DOM（大）。用 python 捕获并检查关键字。\\n\\n还要注意 file:// 协议下 localStorage 工作正常。Chrome headless 对 file:// 的 localStorage OK。\\n\\n风险：Chrome 需要 --no-sandbox 在某些环境。加上试试。\\n\\n写 python 脚本驱动。\",\"content\":\"有 Chrome/Edge 可用。用 Chrome headless `--dump-dom` 做真实浏览器端到端验证（逐路径加载并检查渲染结果）：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"有 Chrome/Edge 可用。用 Chrome headless `--dump-dom` 做真实浏览器端到端验证（逐路径加载并检查渲染结果）：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":38,\"round\":38,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":38,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:11:34'),
(1308, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 164234, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-38\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Global root is C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\npm\\\\node_modules — check if jsdom is there. Actually, when the sandbox executed my earlier command, maybe the `cd /d` failed silently or the sandbox normalizes cwd. The install said \\\"added 38 packages\\\". Where? Let me check if jsdom exists at the global root or at C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\node_modules (npm walks up from the temp dir if cd failed? No—npm installs in cwd).\\n\\nHmm, wait — maybe the sandbox maps the temp dir writes to a virtual overlay, and the actual install went into the *sandbox\'s* view. The `dir` earlier showed study-jsdom empty. Odd.\\n\\nLet me just check whether jsdom is resolvable from a script placed IN the temp study-jsdom folder... it\'s empty. Let me search for a jsdom directory quickly in likely spots (Roaming npm node_modules, Local Temp, Administrator home).\",\"content\":\"正在调用工具。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"正在调用工具。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":38,\"round\":38,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":38,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:11:34'),
(1309, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 164235, 'tool.started', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', 'call_00_2CqIevZssVqvqqCofvYw9335', '{\"tool_key\":\"python_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Python 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"code\":\"import subprocess, os\\n\\nchrome = r\'C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\'\\nbase = \'file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html\'\\n\\nchecks = [\\n    (\'#/work\', [\'work-overview\', \'我的工作区\', \'今日待办\', \'收件箱\', \'项目备忘\', \'会议与日志\']),\\n    (\'#/work/todos\', [\'work-todos\', \'重要紧急\', \'重要不紧急\', \'紧急不重要\', \'不重要不紧急\', \'新建待办\', \'快速添加待办\']),\\n    (\'#/work/inbox\', [\'work-inbox\', \'未清理\', \'一键清空已完成\', \'记一下\']),\\n    (\'#/work/projects\', [\'work-projects\', \'新建项目\', \'产品 3.0 改版\', \'公考行测刷题计划\', \'搜索项目名\']),\\n    (\'#/work/projects/seed-proj-1\', [\'work-detail\', \'产品 3.0 改版\', \'创建日期\', \'任务\', \'笔记\', \'文件\', \'添加任务\']),\\n    (\'#/work/log\', [\'work-log\', \'生成周报\', \'生成月报\', \'完成时间线\']),\\n    (\'#/work/meetings\', [\'work-meetings\', \'新建会议记录\', \'项目周会\', \'需求评审会\']),\\n]\\n\\nuser_data = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\'TEMP\', \'.\'), \'wb_chrome_profile\')\\nos.makedirs(user_data, exist_ok=True)\\n\\nresults = []\\nfor frag, keywords in checks:\\n    url = base + frag\\n    try:\\n        r = subprocess.run([\\n            chrome, \'--headless=new\', \'--disable-gpu\', \'--no-sandbox\',\\n            \'--user-data-dir=\' + user_data,\\n            \'--virtual-time-budget=4000\', \'--dump-dom\', url\\n        ], capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=60)\\n        dom = r.stdout\\n        missing = [k for k in keywords if k not in dom]\\n        results.append((frag, r.returncode, missing, len(dom)))\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        results.append((frag, -1, [str(e)], 0))\\n\\nprint(\'=== 端到端渲染验证（Chrome headless） ===\')\\nallok = True\\nfor frag, rc, missing, domlen in results:\\n    ok = rc == 0 and not missing\\n    if not ok:\\n        allok = False\\n    print((\'PASS\' if ok else \'FAIL\'), frag, \'| exit=\', rc, \'| domlen=\', domlen, \'| missing=\', missing)\\nprint(\'\\\\nALL PASS\' if allok else \'\\\\nHAS FAILURES\')\\n\"},\"effect\":\"write\",\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"phase\":null,\"operation_id\":null,\"intent\":null,\"shell\":null,\"command_fingerprint\":null}', '2026-08-03 14:11:34'),
