(1318, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 165484, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_work-turn-39\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"问题：`capture_output=True, text=True` 在 Windows 上默认用 gbk 解码，而 Chrome 输出的 DOM 是 UTF-8 中文 → UnicodeDecodeError → stdout 为 None → 断言失败。修复：用 `encoding=\'utf-8\', errors=\'replace\'`。\",\"content\":\"编码问题（Windows 默认 gbk 解码 Chrome 的 UTF-8 输出）。用显式 utf-8 解码重跑：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"编码问题（Windows 默认 gbk 解码 Chrome 的 UTF-8 输出）。用显式 utf-8 解码重跑：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":39,\"round\":39,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":39,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:12:32'),
(1319, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 165485, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-39\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"jsdom not in global root or Temp. The npm install must have gone somewhere else — possibly the sandbox gives each command a virtual filesystem or the install went into the executor\'s internal workspace (a sandbox overlay). The install reported success but files aren\'t visible on the real FS — likely the sandbox virtualizes %TEMP% writes.\\n\\nI shouldn\'t burn more time hunting. Decision: jsdom-based testing isn\'t reliably available in this sandbox. I\'ve already got:\\n1. node --check syntax ✓\\n2. Load test: 13 routes registered, no runtime errors ✓\\n3. Render smoke: all 14 path renders, no undefined/NaN, key markers ✓\\n\\nFor interaction-level confidence without jsdom, I can do a manual static review pass of the mount code (already done during writing). Also I can write a lightweight custom DOM shim test targeting the most critical mount behaviors — but that\'s a lot of code with brittle fidelity.\\n\\nAlternative pragmatic middle ground: test the pure logic functions by extracting them? They\'re closure-private. I could restructure study.js to expose a debug namespace (e.g., window.__studyTest) — but that adds non-required surface to the deliverable. Hmm — actually it could be useful and harmless: expose a tiny test hook only when a flag is set? I\'d rather not add test scaffolding to the production file.\\n\\nGiven constraints and diminishing returns, I\'ll do a focused static review of the mount handlers (re-reading the file sections) to catch obvious issues, plus one more targeted check: verify no duplicate element IDs across pages and that all IDs referenced in mount exist in render output (can automate this!). Let me write a quick static checker script that:\\n1. Parses render output for each page (harness2 style with store) → collect id=\\\"...\\\" values.\\n2. Extracts all `querySelector(\'#...\')` / `getElementById(\'#...\')` references from the study.js source per definition — harder. Simpler: for each page, extract ids used in mount from source text? That\'s fragile.\\n\\nSimpler approach: for each page render output, collect all ids; then grep study.js source for `\'#st-` occurrences and check each exists in some render output. Do it in one node script. That catches ID mismatch bugs — valuable.\\n\\nLet me write harness4 (static cross-check):\\n- Load study.js with stub store (like harness2).\\n- For each registered def, render → collect ids via regex /id=\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\"/g.\\n- Read study.js source, find all occurrences of `#st-...` in querySelector/getElementById strings: regex /(?:querySelector|getElementById)\\\\(\'#?([a-zA-Z0-9_-]+)\'\\\\)/g — collect selectors starting with \'#\'.\\n- For each selector, assert the id appears in at least one render output (per its own page ideally, but global set is fine — with care: some selectors are used in modal html which isn\'t rendered via def.render... e.g., \'#f-module\' inside modal string built in openAddQuestionModal — that\'s a template literal in source, not via querySelector with \'#\'. My regex only catches querySelector/getElementById calls. Modal queries like mask.querySelector(\'#f-module\') — mask is the modal; ids defined in modal HTML strings. To check those, also collect ids from all template literal HTML? Complex.\\n\\nSimpler targeted check: for each `querySelector(\'#X\')` in the file where the element is expected within page render (mount binds on `el.querySelector` / `el` containers), check X appears in the corresponding page\'s render output. Mapping query→page is complex.\\n\\nTime-box this: I\'ll do a lighter static validation — extract all `#st-` ids from render outputs across all 14 renders, and all `#st-` ids referenced in the whole source via querySelector/getElementById; assert every referenced id exists in at least one render output OR is created via openModal html (check modal html strings contain id too — modal htmls are template literals in source; I can extract them from source with a regex for `id=\\\"st-...\\\"`/`id=\\\"f-...\\\"` inside the file). Combined set: all `id=\\\"...\\\"` in source file + all rendered ids; referenced selectors must be in that combined set. That\'s a decent approximation.\\n\\nLet me write harness4 doing:\\n1. Load with stub store (harness2-like).\\n2. Collect rendered ids: render all paths, regex id=\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\".\\n3. Collect source ids: read file, regex /id=\\\"([^\\\"]+)\\\"/g (covers render templates + modal htmls).\\n4. Collect referenced selectors: regex /(?:querySelector|getElementById)\\\\(\\\\s*[\'\\\"]#([\\\\w-]+)[\'\\\"]\\\\s*\\\\)/g.\\n5. Missing = referenced not in (renderedIds ∪ sourceIds). Report.\\n\\nAlso check duplicate ids within each render output (should be none within a page).\\n\\nThis is quick to write. Let me do it.\",\"content\":\"jsdom 在沙箱中不可可靠使用（安装被虚拟化）。改用静态交叉校验：渲染输出的 `id` 与源码中 `querySelector/getElementById(\'#...\')` 引用做一致性检查，能有效捕获 ID 错配类缺陷。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"jsdom 在沙箱中不可可靠使用（安装被虚拟化）。改用静态交叉校验：渲染输出的 `id` 与源码中 `querySelector/getElementById(\'#...\')` 引用做一致性检查，能有效捕获 ID 错配类缺陷。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":39,\"round\":39,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":39,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:12:32'),
(1320, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 165486, 'tool.started', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', 'call_00_p7urWDZwsiXWl1OIdAU52708', '{\"tool_key\":\"python_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Python 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"code\":\"import subprocess, os\\n\\nchrome = r\'C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\'\\nbase = \'file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html\'\\n\\nchecks = [\\n    (\'#/work\', [\'work-overview\', \'我的工作区\', \'今日待办\', \'收件箱\', \'项目备忘\', \'会议与日志\']),\\n    (\'#/work/todos\', [\'work-todos\', \'重要紧急\', \'重要不紧急\', \'紧急不重要\', \'不重要不紧急\', \'新建待办\', \'快速添加待办\']),\\n    (\'#/work/inbox\', [\'work-inbox\', \'未清理\', \'一键清空已完成\', \'记一下\']),\\n    (\'#/work/projects\', [\'work-projects\', \'新建项目\', \'产品 3.0 改版\', \'公考行测刷题计划\', \'搜索项目名\']),\\n    (\'#/work/projects/seed-proj-1\', [\'work-detail\', \'产品 3.0 改版\', \'创建日期\', \'任务\', \'笔记\', \'文件\', \'添加任务\']),\\n    (\'#/work/log\', [\'work-log\', \'生成周报\', \'生成月报\', \'完成时间线\']),\\n    (\'#/work/meetings\', [\'work-meetings\', \'新建会议记录\', \'项目周会\', \'需求评审会\']),\\n]\\n\\nuser_data = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\'TEMP\', \'.\'), \'wb_chrome_profile\')\\nos.makedirs(user_data, exist_ok=True)\\n\\nresults = []\\nfor frag, keywords in checks:\\n    url = base + frag\\n    try:\\n        r = subprocess.run([\\n            chrome, \'--headless=new\', \'--disable-gpu\', \'--no-sandbox\',\\n            \'--user-data-dir=\' + user_data,\\n            \'--virtual-time-budget=4000\', \'--dump-dom\', url\\n        ], capture_output=True, timeout=60)\\n        dom = r.stdout.decode(\'utf-8\', errors=\'replace\')\\n        missing = [k for k in keywords if k not in dom]\\n        results.append((frag, r.returncode, missing, len(dom)))\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        results.append((frag, -1, [str(e)], 0))\\n\\nprint(\'=== 端到端渲染验证（Chrome headless --dump-dom） ===\')\\nallok = True\\nfor frag, rc, missing, domlen in results:\\n    ok = rc == 0 and not missing\\n    if not ok:\\n        allok = False\\n    print((\'PASS\' if ok else \'FAIL\'), frag, \'| exit=\', rc, \'| domlen=\', domlen, \'| missing=\', missing)\\nprint(\'\\\\nALL PASS\' if allok else \'\\\\nHAS FAILURES\')\\n\"},\"effect\":\"write\",\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"phase\":null,\"operation_id\":null,\"intent\":null,\"shell\":null,\"command_fingerprint\":null}', '2026-08-03 14:12:32'),
(1321, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 165487, 'approval.required', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_work', 'call_00_p7urWDZwsiXWl1OIdAU52708', '{\"id\":\"9fc95cd9-30cd-4018-88fc-30a4fab28edb\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"expires_at\":null,\"reason\":\"工具风险级别为 high\",\"tool_key\":\"python_executor\",\"arguments\":{\"code\":\"import subprocess, os\\n\\nchrome = r\'C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Google\\\\Chrome\\\\Application\\\\chrome.exe\'\\nbase = \'file:///D:/Project/Project/ccee/web1/index.html\'\\n\\nchecks = [\\n    (\'#/work\', [\'work-overview\', \'我的工作区\', \'今日待办\', \'收件箱\', \'项目备忘\', \'会议与日志\']),\\n    (\'#/work/todos\', [\'work-todos\', \'重要紧急\', \'重要不紧急\', \'紧急不重要\', \'不重要不紧急\', \'新建待办\', \'快速添加待办\']),\\n    (\'#/work/inbox\', [\'work-inbox\', \'未清理\', \'一键清空已完成\', \'记一下\']),\\n    (\'#/work/projects\', [\'work-projects\', \'新建项目\', \'产品 3.0 改版\', \'公考行测刷题计划\', \'搜索项目名\']),\\n    (\'#/work/projects/seed-proj-1\', [\'work-detail\', \'产品 3.0 改版\', \'创建日期\', \'任务\', \'笔记\', \'文件\', \'添加任务\']),\\n    (\'#/work/log\', [\'work-log\', \'生成周报\', \'生成月报\', \'完成时间线\']),\\n    (\'#/work/meetings\', [\'work-meetings\', \'新建会议记录\', \'项目周会\', \'需求评审会\']),\\n]\\n\\nuser_data = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\'TEMP\', \'.\'), \'wb_chrome_profile\')\\nos.makedirs(user_data, exist_ok=True)\\n\\nresults = []\\nfor frag, keywords in checks:\\n    url = base + frag\\n    try:\\n        r = subprocess.run([\\n            chrome, \'--headless=new\', \'--disable-gpu\', \'--no-sandbox\',\\n            \'--user-data-dir=\' + user_data,\\n            \'--virtual-time-budget=4000\', \'--dump-dom\', url\\n        ], capture_output=True, timeout=60)\\n        dom = r.stdout.decode(\'utf-8\', errors=\'replace\')\\n        missing = [k for k in keywords if k not in dom]\\n        results.append((frag, r.returncode, missing, len(dom)))\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        results.append((frag, -1, [str(e)], 0))\\n\\nprint(\'=== 端到端渲染验证（Chrome headless --dump-dom） ===\')\\nallok = True\\nfor frag, rc, missing, domlen in results:\\n    ok = rc == 0 and not missing\\n    if not ok:\\n        allok = False\\n    print((\'PASS\' if ok else \'FAIL\'), frag, \'| exit=\', rc, \'| domlen=\', domlen, \'| missing=\', missing)\\nprint(\'\\\\nALL PASS\' if allok else \'\\\\nHAS FAILURES\')\\n\"}}', '2026-08-03 14:12:32'),
