(1385, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 175615, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-45\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Now add the type variable and binding AFTER openModal, before the closing of the function. Current tail of openNewPlanModal:\\n\\n```js\\n        App.store.plans.add({ type: type, title: title, start: start, end: end, modules: mods, progress: 0, status: \'active\' });\\n        close();\\n        App.showToast(\'计划已创建\', \'success\');\\n        if (onDone) onDone();\\n      }\\n    });\\n  }\\n```\\n\\nI need: declare `var type = \'week\';` before openModal call (or right after mask assignment), and bind seg buttons after openModal. Insert after `var mask = App.openModal(`...`...), { ... });` — i.e., after the closing `});` of openModal, add:\\n\\n```js\\n    // 类型切换（需在弹窗打开后立即绑定，避免确认时监听未挂上）\\n    var type = \'week\';\\n    var seg = mask.querySelector(\'#np-type\');\\n    if (seg) {\\n      seg.querySelectorAll(\'.seg-btn\').forEach(function (b) {\\n        b.addEventListener(\'click\', function () {\\n          type = b.dataset.type;\\n          seg.querySelectorAll(\'.seg-btn\').forEach(function (x) { x.classList.toggle(\'active\', x === b); });\\n        });\\n      });\\n    }\\n```\\n\\nPlace right after the openModal call block. The openModal call ends with:\\n```\\n        if (onDone) onDone();\\n      }\\n    });\\n  }\\n```\\nThat\'s the end of openNewPlanModal. I\'ll insert before the final `}`. Use str_replace on the tail.\",\"content\":\"正在调用工具。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"正在调用工具。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":45,\"round\":45,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":45,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:21:04'),
