(1429, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 177939, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-52\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Progress! jsdom loaded and the test ran — the failure is `card.scrollIntoView is not a function` in jsdom (jsdom doesn\'t implement scrollIntoView). This is a TEST ENVIRONMENT limitation, not a product bug (real browsers have scrollIntoView). Fix the harness: patch Element.prototype.scrollIntoView = function(){} before loading study.js (or before running the questions test).\\n\\nThis is the jsdom path — great news: jsdom IS usable within a single call! Let me add the polyfill to harness3 and re-run. Also anticipate other jsdom gaps:\\n- scrollIntoView → polyfill.\\n- Possibly `matchMedia` — not used in my code.\\n- `window.Event` — I use `new window.Event(\'input\', {bubbles:true})` — jsdom supports.\\n- CSS transitions — jsdom ignores, fine.\\n- `el.offsetWidth` — jsdom returns 0, fine.\\n- `location.hash` — jsdom with url; detail mount uses location.hash only when pill missing — fine.\\n- `document.body.classList` — fine.\\n\\nAdd polyfill right after dom creation:\\n```js\\nwindow.Element.prototype.scrollIntoView = function () {};\\n```\\nHmm — does jsdom\'s Element have prototype accessible via window.Element? Yes.\\n\\nAlso the clock test waits 1150ms real time — fine.\\n\\nAlso there may be an issue in the questions focus flow test — I don\'t test focus. OK.\\n\\nLet me patch harness3 and rerun (install + test in same call again — install is cached now via npm cache, ~45s but hopefully faster with cache... it will reinstall into the overlay again. Acceptable.\",\"content\":\"jsdom 已在单次调用内可用，失败仅是 jsdom 未实现 `scrollIntoView`（测试环境限制，非产品缺陷）。给测试补 polyfill 后重跑。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"jsdom 已在单次调用内可用，失败仅是 jsdom 未实现 `scrollIntoView`（测试环境限制，非产品缺陷）。给测试补 polyfill 后重跑。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":52,\"round\":52,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":52,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:31:35'),
