(1514, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 212277, 'agent.turn.completed', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"pages_study-turn-66\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"Wait — one issue with the new wrong test flow: after round-3 w1 archived, the \'已归档\' tab should show w3 (already archived) + w1 = 2 items ✓. But also — the archive of w1 happens via update (status archived) — w3 was archived ✓ → 2 archived ✓.\\n\\nBut careful: round-2 flow — after w2 answered correctly (consecutive 1), I click exit. Then round-3: click w1 → enterReview → queue = [w1(learning, consec 2), w2(learning, consec 1)] → w1 answer A → consecutive 3 → ARCHIVED ✓ + celebration ✓.\\n\\nAlso check round-1: after w1 correct → next → w2 panel with options A,B — `[data-opt=\\\"B\\\"]` ✓. Then w2 wrong → B (answer A) → pending, consec 0, +1 day ✓.\\n\\nRound-2: next → done panel? Queue [w1, w2] — reviewIdx was 1 (w2), next → 2 → done panel → `[data-review-exit]` exists ✓ click → exit. WAIT — my round-2 code: after w2 wrong, `click(review, \'#st-review-next\')` → reviewIdx 2 → DONE panel → then `if (review.querySelectorAll(\'[data-opt]\').length !== 2) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮面板异常\')` — DONE panel has 0 options → FAILURE!! \\n\\nHmm — my round-2 flow comment says \\\"w2 答对（连续 1 次）\\\" — I intended to answer w2 correctly in round 2. Let me re-trace: round 1: w1 A (correct, consec 1) → next → w2 → B (WRONG, consec 0, pending) → next → reviewIdx=2 → done panel. Round 2: I need to re-enter and answer w2 correctly... \\n\\nMy written round-2 code: `click(review, \'#st-review-next\'); if (options !== 2)...` — but after w2\'s wrong answer in round 1, next → done panel (0 options) → \'第二轮面板异常\' failure. The flow needs: exit done panel → re-enter w2 (or w1?) — wait, my goal for round 2: get w2 correct once (consec 1) and set up for round 3\'s w1 archiving... Actually, w2\'s consecutive doesn\'t matter for w1\'s archiving! The only requirement: w1 needs 3 consecutive correct answers. Round 1: w1 correct (1). Round 3: w1 correct (2)... wait no — round 3 answers w1 ONCE more → consec 3 → archived. But w1\'s consecutive: round 1 → 1. Round 3 → 2! NOT 3!!\\n\\nHmm!! Let me recount: applyReviewResult: consecutive = correct ? (old || 0) + 1 : 0.\\n- Round 1: w1 A → consec 1.\\n- Round 3 (later): w1 A → consec 2. NOT archived!\\n\\nSo w1 needs THREE review sessions with correct answers: round1 (1), round2 (2), round3 (3 → archive). My round-2 must answer w1 correctly again! But the queue auto-advances to w2 after w1... So round 2: enter w1 → A (consec 2) → next → w2 → answer B (wrong — resets w2, doesn\'t matter) OR answer A (correct)... then exit. Round 3: enter w1 → A (consec 3 → ARCHIVED ✓).\\n\\nSo my round-2 section should be: enter w1 → A → next → (w2 panel) → answer anything → exit. Let me rewrite round 2:\\n\\n```js\\n// —— 第二轮：w1 再次答对（连续 2 次）——\\nclick(el, \'[data-review=\\\"w1\\\"]\');\\nreview = el.querySelector(\'#st-wrong-review\');\\nvar r2a = review.querySelector(\'[data-opt=\\\"A\\\"]\');\\nif (!r2a) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮选项缺失\'); else r2a.click();\\nvar w1r2 = store.wrongQuestions.get(\'w1\');\\nif (w1r2.consecutive !== 2 || w1r2.status !== \'learning\') failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮状态错误: \' + JSON.stringify(w1r2));\\nclick(review, \'#st-review-next\');\\n// w2 面板：随意答一次后退出\\nvar r2b = review.querySelector(\'[data-opt=\\\"A\\\"]\');\\nif (!r2b) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮第二题缺失\'); else r2b.click();\\nclick(review, \'[data-review-exit]\');\\n\\n// —— 第三轮：w1 第 3 次答对 → 归档 ——\\nclick(el, \'[data-review=\\\"w1\\\"]\');\\n...\\n```\\n\\nHmm wait — but after round 2\'s next click, the w2 panel shows; answering w2\'s A (correct) → w2 consec 1 → result panel with #st-review-next AND [data-review-exit] — click exit ✓.\\n\\nBut hold on — there\'s a problem with round 2\'s enter: after round 1, w1 is \'learning\' (consec 1), w2 \'pending\'. Queue sorted by nextReview: w2 nextReview = +1 day (round-1 wrong), w1 nextReview = +2 days. So queue = [w2, w1]!! Clicking w1\'s item → enterReview finds w1 at index 1 → renders w1 directly (reviewIdx = findIndex) ✓ — fine, it renders w1 regardless of position.\\n\\nRound 3: w1 consec 3 → archived ✓. After archiving, queue advance → w2 → the test then clicks exit ✓.\\n\\nWait — round 3: `click(el, \'[data-review=\\\"w1\\\"]\')` — after round 2\'s exit, list re-rendered; w1 item exists ✓ → enter → A → consec 3 → archived ✓ + celebration ✓. Then exit → list. \'已归档\' tab → w3 + w1 = 2 ✓.\\n\\nAlso — after w1 archived in round 3, exit: `click(review, \'[data-review-exit]\')` — result panel has exit ✓.\\n\\nOne more check — round 2 assertion `w1r2.consecutive !== 2` — after r2a click, w1 consec = 1+1 = 2 ✓.\\n\\nLet me fix the round-2 block. Also note round-2\'s first action: re-enter w1 — `click(el, \'[data-review=\\\"w1\\\"]\')`. Then review = re-query.\",\"content\":\"第二轮流程有误（w1 需要三轮复习才能归档），修正。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"summary\":\"第二轮流程有误（w1 需要三轮复习才能归档），修正。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":66,\"round\":66,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":66,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-03 14:53:27'),
(1515, '40122540-fcbb-4890-9b07-1296c60efc8f', 212278, 'tool.started', 'code', 'moonya', 'pages_study', 'call_00_COFV0YdfdV0tP4Z5f8q59242', '{\"tool_key\":\"edit_file\",\"display_name\":\"Edit File\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"str_replace\",\"new_str\":\"    // —— 第二轮：w1 再次答对（连续 2 次）——\\n    click(el, \'[data-review=\\\"w1\\\"]\');\\n    review = el.querySelector(\'#st-wrong-review\');\\n    var r2a = review.querySelector(\'[data-opt=\\\"A\\\"]\');\\n    if (!r2a) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮选项缺失\'); else r2a.click();\\n    var w1r2 = store.wrongQuestions.get(\'w1\');\\n    if (w1r2.consecutive !== 2 || w1r2.status !== \'learning\') failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮状态错误: \' + JSON.stringify(w1r2));\\n    click(review, \'#st-review-next\');\\n    // w2 面板：答一次后退出（不影响 w1 的连续次数）\\n    var r2b = review.querySelector(\'[data-opt=\\\"A\\\"]\');\\n    if (!r2b) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮第二题缺失\'); else r2b.click();\\n    click(review, \'[data-review-exit]\');\",\"old_str\":\"    // —— 第二轮：w2 答对（连续 1 次），退出 ——\\n    click(review, \'#st-review-next\');\\n    if (review.querySelectorAll(\'[data-opt]\').length !== 2) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮面板异常\');\\n    var w2a = review.querySelector(\'[data-opt=\\\"A\\\"]\');\\n    if (!w2a) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮选项缺失\'); else w2a.click();\\n    var w2b = store.wrongQuestions.get(\'w2\');\\n    if (w2b.status !== \'learning\' || w2b.consecutive !== 1) failures.push(\'wrong: 第二轮答对更新错误: \' + JSON.stringify(w2b));\\n    click(review, \'[data-review-exit]\');\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\study-harness3.js\"},\"effect\":\"write\",\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"phase\":null,\"operation_id\":null,\"intent\":null,\"shell\":null,\"command_fingerprint\":null}', '2026-08-03 14:53:27'),
