(1792, '4b05cadf-859a-40c8-82a7-2bfabe287a60', 874, 'agent.turn.completed', 'computer', 'moonya', 'empty_recycle_bin', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"empty_recycle_bin-turn-14\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"回收站窗口没有打开。Win+R + 输入 shell:RecycleBinFolder 没有生效，可能是因为 MoonYa 窗口抢占了焦点，或者运行对话框没有打开。\\n\\n让我重新尝试：按 Win+D 显示桌面，看看桌面上的回收站图标，然后双击它。或者再按 Win+R 并输入。\\n\\n先按 win+d 显示桌面，然后截屏观察。\",\"content\":\"回收站窗口未打开。先按 Win+D 显示桌面查看回收站图标：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":160,\"received_content_chars\":30,\"summary\":\"回收站窗口未打开。先按 Win+D 显示桌面查看回收站图标：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":14,\"round\":14,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":14,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-07 10:26:40'),
