(1870, '6d73522c-cddb-40b4-bde4-233925ec3765', 88, 'agent.turn.completed', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"6d73522c-cddb-40b4-bde4-233925ec3765-moonya-turn-1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The user asked me to explain an image, but the visual attachment processing status says the Image Agent failed to obtain visual evidence. I must not guess the attachment content. I need to clearly state that I currently cannot read the image/video.\\n\\nAccording to the protocol, this is a case where I should use respond_without_delegation with reason \\\"unsupported\\\" or \\\"chat\\\"... Actually, the situation is: the user wants image explanation, but the visual attachment cannot be read. Should I delegate to media.visual_understanding? The instruction says \\\"Image Agent未能取得视觉证据。MoonYa不得猜测附件内容，必须明确说明当前无法读取这些图片/视频。\\\"\\n\\nSo I should respond without delegation, stating that the image cannot be read. The reason could be \\\"unsupported\\\" since the capability currently cannot obtain the visual evidence. Or \\\"clarification\\\" - asking the user to re-upload. I think a mix: explain that the attachment can\'t be read and ask to re-upload.\\n\\nI\'ll use respond_without_delegation with reason \\\"unsupported\\\" or \\\"clarification\\\". The most fitting is \\\"unsupported\\\" since the image processing failed, but asking user to re-upload is a clarification. I\'ll choose \\\"clarification\\\" since I need the user to provide a readable attachment, or \\\"unsupported\\\" to say current capability cannot handle it. Either is defensible. I\'ll go with \\\"unsupported\\\" — stating that I currently cannot read the image, and asking them to re-upload. Actually asking to re-upload is clarification. Let me pick \\\"clarification\\\" since the path forward is for the user to re-supply the attachment. Hmm, but the key point is that the tool can\'t read it — that\'s unsupported at the moment. I\'ll use \\\"unsupported\\\" and still ask them to re-upload, that seems reasonable. Or clarification... The description: \\\"仅用于闲聊、需要向用户补充提问，或当前能力明确不支持的请求。\\\" Both fit. I\'ll choose \\\"unsupported\\\" because the media.visual_understanding capability currently fails to obtain evidence.\\n\\nResponse should be concise and clear, in Chinese.\",\"content\":\"抱歉，我目前无法解释这张图片。\\n\\n系统在处理你上传的图片时未能成功获取视觉内容（图片 Agent 没有取得可用的视觉证据），因此我无法确认图片里到底显示的是什么，也不会去猜测或编造内容。\\n\\n建议你：\\n1. **重新上传**这张图片，确认文件完整、格式为常见的 JPG/PNG 等；\\n2. 如果图片较大，可以尝试压缩后再上传；\\n3. 上传后请再发一次\\\"解释这张图片\\\"，我会重新尝试读取。\\n\\n如果图片仍然无法被读取，你也可以用文字描述一下图片内容或你想了解的重点，我可以基于你的描述尽力帮你分析。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":1948,\"received_content_chars\":246,\"summary\":\"抱歉，我目前无法解释这张图片。 系统在处理你上传的图片时未能成功获取视觉内容（图片 Agent 没有取得可用的视觉证据），因此我无法确认图片里到底显示的是什么，也不会去猜测或编造内容。 建议你： 1. **重新上传**这张图片，确认文件完整、格式为常见的 JPG/PNG 等； 2. 如果图片较大，可以尝试压缩后再上传； 3. 上传后请再发一次\\\"解释这张图片\\\"，我会重新尝试读取。 如果图片仍然无法被读取，你也可以用文字描述一下图片内容或你想了解的重点，我可以基于你的描述尽力帮你…\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"phase\":\"planning\",\"round\":1,\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"http_status\":200},\"phase\":\"planning\",\"round\":1,\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}', '2026-08-07 11:36:19'),
(1871, '6d73522c-cddb-40b4-bde4-233925ec3765', 89, 'agent.failed', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"status\":\"failed\",\"summary\":\"本次 Work 运行既没有取得员工 Agent 的结构化执行结果，也没有产生有效的直接回复。MoonYa 已拒绝把未执行的文字当作成果。\",\"error\":{\"code\":\"coordination_tool_required\",\"message\":\"协调模型未调用团队委派或直接回复工具\"}}', '2026-08-07 11:36:19'),
