(2123, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 46, 'agent.turn.completed', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f-moonya-turn-1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The user asks \\\"我电脑上有什么\\\" (What\'s on my computer?). This is asking about the local system state — what\'s installed, what files exist, etc. This is a system inquiry task. I should delegate to computer.system or file.management to check system state.\\n\\nThe question is ambiguous: \\\"我电脑上有什么\\\" could mean installed software, files, folders, etc. A reasonable interpretation: check the computer\'s basic state — installed applications, disk usage, maybe common folders. I could delegate a task to computer.system to inspect installed software and disk, and maybe file.management to overview common directories.\\n\\nSince this is an executable task (checking system state), I should use delegate_to_agents. Let me delegate to computer.system to gather system overview: installed apps, disk space, OS info. Maybe also file.management to list common user directories. But to avoid overreach, a single computer.system task covering system overview makes sense. Perhaps also ask file.management for a quick overview of user folders. Let me do two tasks in parallel since they\'re independent.\\n\\nTask1: computer.system —检查本机系统状态：操作系统版本、磁盘空间、内存占用、已安装的应用列表（如通过注册表或包管理器查询）。\\nTask2: file.management —概览用户主目录下常见文件夹（桌面、文档、下载等）的内容概况（文件数量、占用大小），不需要深入每个文件。\\n\\nBoth are independent, so parallel delegation.\",\"content\":\"\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":1271,\"received_content_chars\":0,\"summary\":\"The user asks \\\"我电脑上有什么\\\" (What\'s on my computer?). This is asking about the local system state — what\'s installed, what files exist, etc. This is a system inquiry task. I should delegate to computer.system or file.management to check system …\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"phase\":\"planning\",\"round\":1,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\",\"http_status\":200},\"phase\":\"planning\",\"round\":1,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-08 11:33:57'),
(2124, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 47, 'delegation.accepted', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, 'call_00_DCXvLRd84zjDgO9KV85t3923', '{\"dispatch_status\":\"accepted\",\"tasks\":[{\"id\":\"sys-overview\",\"agent_key\":\"computer\",\"capability_key\":\"computer.system\",\"agent_display_name\":\"Computer Agent\",\"instruction\":\"检查本机系统状态并返回概览：操作系统版本与架构、CPU/内存概况、各磁盘分区可用空间、已安装应用程序列表（常见应用按名称分组即可）。只做只读检查，不修改任何系统设置。\",\"depends_on\":[],\"selection_reason\":\"用户询问电脑上有什么，需要读取本机系统状态与应用安装情况。\"},{\"id\":\"file-overview\",\"agent_key\":\"file\",\"capability_key\":\"file.management\",\"agent_display_name\":\"File Agent\",\"instruction\":\"只读概览用户主目录下常见文件夹（桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频等）的内容概况：每个文件夹下的条目数量、总占用大小、以及一两个有代表性的文件或子文件夹名称，用于让用户快速了解自己电脑上存了哪些内容。不要递归列出所有文件，不做任何修改或删除。\",\"depends_on\":[],\"selection_reason\":\"用户询问电脑里有什么，需要概览常见目录中的文件内容概况。\"}]}', '2026-08-08 11:33:57'),
