(2130, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 135, 'agent.turn.completed', 'file', 'moonya', 'file-overview', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"file-overview-turn-1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The user wants a read-only overview of common folders in the user\'s home directory (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Pictures, Videos, etc.): item count per folder, total size, and one or two representative file/folder names. No recursion of all files, no modifications.\\n\\nI should use shell_executor with inspect phase to do read-only checks. Let me first inspect the user home directory structure.\\n\\nLet me start by inspecting the home directory and listing common folders. I\'ll use PowerShell for this.\\n\\nLet me plan:\\n1. Inspect user home directory to find common folders (Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Pictures, Videos, Music, etc.)\\n2. For each folder, count items (top-level only), total size, and get 1-2 representative names.\\n\\nI should do this in a few inspect calls. First, list the home directory to confirm folder names exist. Since this is read-only, all commands are phase=inspect.\\n\\nLet me write a PowerShell script that:\\n- Gets the home directory\\n- For each common folder that exists, counts top-level items, computes total size (recursive sum for size), and picks 1-2 representative entries.\\n\\nTotal size requires recursion for size, but counting items should be top-level only (per user request: don\'t recursively list all files). Size total usually means full size including subdirectories. I\'ll compute size recursively but count entries at top level only. That\'s fine — the user said don\'t recursively list all files (i.e., don\'t enumerate details), but total size is expected.\\n\\nLet me first do an inspect to see the home directory listing.\",\"content\":\"我来先做只读检查，确认用户主目录结构，再统计各常见文件夹概况。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":1553,\"received_content_chars\":31,\"summary\":\"我来先做只读检查，确认用户主目录结构，再统计各常见文件夹概况。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":1,\"round\":1,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":1,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-08 11:34:03');
