(2134, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 253, 'agent.turn.completed', 'computer', 'moonya', 'sys-overview', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"sys-overview-turn-1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The user wants me to check system status and return an overview: OS version and architecture, CPU/memory overview, disk partition available space, installed applications list (grouped by common app names). Read-only checks only.\\n\\nLet me use the shell_executor for read-only inspections. I should use phase=inspect for all these read-only checks.\\n\\nLet me plan the commands:\\n1. OS version & architecture: `Get-ComputerInfo` or `[System.Environment]::OSVersion` + `$env:PROCESSOR_ARCHITECTURE`. Actually simpler: `Get-CimInstance Win32_OperatingSystem` gives version, architecture, etc.\\n2. CPU/memory: `Get-CimInstance Win32_Processor` and `Get-CimInstance Win32_ComputerSystem` (TotalPhysicalMemory), or use get_system_status tool too.\\n3. Disk partitions: `Get-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk -Filter \\\"DriveType=3\\\"` or `Get-PSDrive -PSProvider FileSystem`.\\n4. Installed applications: registry queries - `HKLM:\\\\Software\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Uninstall\\\\*` and `HKLM:\\\\Software\\\\WOW6432Node\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Uninstall\\\\*` and HKCU.\\n\\nI can also use get_system_status for a quick overview of CPU/memory/disk, but the tool returns maybe simple status. Let me still run the shell commands for detail.\\n\\nSince these are all independent read-only inspections, I can make multiple parallel calls in the same block.\\n\\nLet me create an operation_id like \\\"sysinfo-inspect\\\". Actually per the rules, operation_id is for a subtask; inspect doesn\'t strictly need to match an act. I\'ll use \\\"system-overview-inspect\\\".\\n\\nLet me run:\\n1. OS info: PowerShell\\n2. CPU & memory: PowerShell\\n3. Disk: PowerShell\\n4. Installed apps: PowerShell (registry)\\n\\nLet me batch them in parallel.\\n\\nFor installed apps, the registry query might be large. Group by name. I\'ll output the list of names only. Let me be careful about stderr etc. Exit code expected 0.\\n\\nCommand 1: OS version & architecture\\n```powershell\\n$os = Get-CimInstance Win32_OperatingSystem; $cs = Get-CimInstance Win32_ComputerSystem; Write-Output (\\\"OSName: \\\" + $os.Caption); Write-Output (\\\"OSVersion: \\\" + $os.Version); Write-Output (\\\"Build: \\\" + $os.BuildNumber); Write-Output (\\\"Architecture: \\\" + $os.OSArchitecture); Write-Output (\\\"Manufacturer/Model: \\\" + $cs.Manufacturer + \\\" / \\\" + $cs.Model)\\n```\\n\\nCommand 2: CPU/memory\\n```powershell\\n$cpu = Get-CimInstance Win32_Processor; Write-Output (\\\"CPU: \\\" + $cpu.Name); Write-Output (\\\"Cores: \\\" + $cpu.NumberOfCores + \\\" Logical: \\\" + $cpu.NumberOfLogicalProcessors); $cs = Get-CimInstance Win32_ComputerSystem; Write-Output (\\\"TotalRAM_GB: \\\" + [math]::Round($cs.TotalPhysicalMemory/1GB,2)); $os = Get-CimInstance Win32_OperatingSystem; Write-Output (\\\"FreeRAM_GB: \\\" + [math]::Round($os.FreePhysicalMemory/1MB,2))\\n```\\n\\nCommand 3: Disks\\n```powershell\\nGet-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk -Filter \\\"DriveType=3\\\" | ForEach-Object { Write-Output ($_.DeviceID + \\\" | TotalGB: \\\" + [math]::Round($_.Size/1GB,1) + \\\" | FreeGB: \\\" + [math]::Round($_.FreeSpace/1GB,1) + \\\" | \\\" + $_.VolumeName) }\\n```\\n\\nCommand 4: Installed apps\\n```powershell\\n$paths = \'HKLM:\\\\Software\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Uninstall\\\\*\',\'HKLM:\\\\Software\\\\WOW6432Node\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Uninstall\\\\*\',\'HKCU:\\\\Software\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Uninstall\\\\*\'; Get-ItemProperty $paths -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.DisplayName } | Select-Object -ExpandProperty DisplayName | Sort-Object -Unique\\n```\\n\\nThe apps list may be long; that\'s fine.\\n\\nAlso maybe get_system_status for CPU/memory usage. That\'s a separate tool; can call in parallel too.\\n\\nLet me make these calls in one block since they\'re independent.\",\"content\":\"我来对系统做只读检查，返回结构化概览。先并行执行系统资源状态与硬件信息检查：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":3578,\"received_content_chars\":38,\"summary\":\"我来对系统做只读检查，返回结构化概览。先并行执行系统资源状态与硬件信息检查：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":1,\"round\":1,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":1,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-08 11:34:10'),
