(2137, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 308, 'tool.started', 'computer', 'moonya', 'sys-overview', 'call_01_yC3tEqhSGGviThvGWGRP3340', '{\"tool_key\":\"shell_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Shell 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"$os = Get-CimInstance Win32_OperatingSystem; $cs = Get-CimInstance Win32_ComputerSystem; Write-Output (\\\"OSName: \\\" + $os.Caption); Write-Output (\\\"OSVersion: \\\" + $os.Version); Write-Output (\\\"BuildNumber: \\\" + $os.BuildNumber); Write-Output (\\\"Architecture: \\\" + $os.OSArchitecture); Write-Output (\\\"Computer: \\\" + $cs.Manufacturer + \\\" / \\\" + $cs.Model)\",\"shell\":\"powershell\",\"phase\":\"inspect\",\"operation_id\":\"system-overview-inspect\",\"intent\":\"只读查询操作系统名称、版本、构建号与架构\",\"success_criteria\":{\"expected_exit_code\":0,\"stdout_contains\":[\"OSName:\",\"Architecture:\"]}},\"effect\":\"read\",\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"phase\":\"inspect\",\"operation_id\":\"system-overview-inspect\",\"intent\":\"只读查询操作系统名称、版本、构建号与架构\",\"shell\":\"powershell\",\"command_fingerprint\":\"44bb0fe6755818aa7d4f009e0fbe5dc1f0cfe42e25c3de91e32d6f6b5bde7331\"}', '2026-08-08 11:34:15'),
(2138, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 309, 'tool.completed', 'computer', 'moonya', 'sys-overview', 'call_01_yC3tEqhSGGviThvGWGRP3340', '{\"tool_key\":\"shell_executor\",\"ok\":true,\"content\":\"OSName: Microsoft Windows 11 家庭版 中文版\\r\\nOSVersion: 10.0.26200\\r\\nBuildNumber: 26200\\r\\nArchitecture: 64 位\\r\\nComputer: ASUS / System Product Name\\r\\n\",\"error\":null,\"stage\":\"execute\",\"status\":\"success\",\"error_code\":\"\",\"command_fingerprint\":\"44bb0fe6755818aa7d4f009e0fbe5dc1f0cfe42e25c3de91e32d6f6b5bde7331\",\"operation_receipt\":{\"operation_id\":\"system-overview-inspect\",\"phase\":\"inspect\",\"state\":\"inspected\",\"command_fingerprint\":\"44bb0fe6755818aa7d4f009e0fbe5dc1f0cfe42e25c3de91e32d6f6b5bde7331\",\"intent\":\"只读查询操作系统名称、版本、构建号与架构\",\"completion_mode\":\"\",\"authoritative_verifier\":\"\",\"command_id\":\"\"}}', '2026-08-08 11:34:15'),
(2139, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 310, 'agent.turn.completed', 'file', 'moonya', 'file-overview', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"file-overview-turn-2\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The home directory is C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator. Common folders exist: Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Music, Pictures, Videos, plus others like Doubao, WPS Cloud Files, WPSDrive, source, CodeBuddy, WorkBuddy, AndroidStudioProjects, PyCharmMiscProject, ZCodeProject, etc.\\n\\nNow I\'ll write a PowerShell script that, for each common folder, computes:\\n- top-level item count (folders + files, non-recursive)\\n- total size (recursive sum)\\n- 1-2 representative names (e.g., largest or first entries)\\n\\nThe user asked for \\\"常见文件夹（桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频等）\\\". I\'ll focus on: Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Pictures, Videos, Music, and maybe include a few notable user-created ones (source, Doubao, WPS Cloud Files) as extra context. But keep it focused on common folders primarily.\\n\\nSize calculation can be slow for large folders. Let me run it with a reasonable approach. Total size via Get-ChildItem -Recurse | Measure-Object Length -Sum. This could take a while for Downloads/Documents. It\'s read-only. I\'ll run it synchronously but it might take some seconds. That\'s fine.\\n\\nLet me build the script:\\n\\n```powershell\\n$home = $env:USERPROFILE\\n$folders = @(\'Desktop\',\'Documents\',\'Downloads\',\'Pictures\',\'Videos\',\'Music\')\\nforeach ($f in $folders) {\\n  $p = Join-Path $home $f\\n  if (Test-Path $p) {\\n    $items = @(Get-ChildItem -Force $p -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)\\n    $count = $items.Count\\n    $size = (Get-ChildItem -Force -Recurse $p -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Measure-Object -Property Length -Sum).Sum\\n    $sizeMB = [math]::Round($size/1MB,1)\\n    # representative: pick up to 2 entries, prefer folders then files, maybe largest\\n    $reps = @()\\n    $dirs = $items | Where-Object {$_.PSIsContainer} | Select-Object -First 2 -ExpandProperty Name\\n    $files = $items | Where-Object {!$_.PSIsContainer} | Sort-Object Length -Descending | Select-Object -First 1 -ExpandProperty Name\\n    if ($dirs) { $reps += ($dirs -join \'、\') }\\n    if ($files) { $reps += (\'[文件]\' + $files) }\\n    \\\"{0}`t条目={1}`t大小={2} MB`t代表={3}\\\" -f $f, $count, $sizeMB, ($reps -join \' | \')\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\nOutput as tab-separated lines. Then I\'ll present in Chinese.\\n\\nAlso maybe include a couple of extra folders that are user data (source, Doubao, WPS Cloud Files) — but the user asked for common folders. I\'ll include the standard ones plus a brief note about other notable folders. Actually to be helpful, I could add Doubao, WPS Cloud Files, WPSDrive, source as \\\"其他可见文件夹\\\" in the overview. But sizes might be big. Let me include the main 6 first, and maybe a second pass for a few notable ones. To keep it manageable, I\'ll run the main 6 plus a few user-visible ones (source, Doubao, WPS Cloud Files, WPSDrive, AndroidStudioProjects, ZCodeProject, PyCharmMiscProject, CodeBuddy, WorkBuddy). Actually, that might take long. Let me just do the 6 common + list other visible folders\' names and item counts with sizes too. \\n\\nHmm, to be reasonable: do 6 common folders with full stats, plus quickly count top-level entries of other visible folders (no recursive size) to mention. Actually recursive size for Desktop/Documents/Downloads might be large. Let me just run it; the environment is a sandbox. I\'ll set a finite blocking run but it could take minutes. The instructions say unknown-duration commands must use blocking=false with finite completion mode. Recursive size over Documents/Downloads could be slow but typically within seconds to a minute. It\'s safer to use blocking=false with completion_mode=finite for the size computation? The rule: \\\"未知时长、下载、构建、测试和服务启动必须使用 blocking=false，并显式选择 completion_mode\\\". Size scanning is unknown duration, so I should use blocking=false + finite.\\n\\nBut then I don\'t get the output directly; the coordinator waits and returns once. \\\"受管 finite 作业由协调器内部等待并只返回一次最终结果，不得调用 get_command_status 人工反复轮询。\\\" OK so I can use blocking=false with completion_mode=finite and the result will be returned once. Good.\\n\\nLet me do that for the stats computation. Also include additional visible folders summary.\\n\\nLet me write the script to be robust and output clean lines.\",\"content\":\"主目录 `C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator` 下的常见文件夹（桌面/文档/下载/图片/视频/音乐）都存在。接下来统计各文件夹的条目数、总占用大小和代表性条目（只读，不修改任何内容）。由于总大小需递归扫描、时长不定，采用受管后台方式执行：\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":4039,\"received_content_chars\":124,\"summary\":\"主目录 `C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator` 下的常见文件夹（桌面/文档/下载/图片/视频/音乐）都存在。接下来统计各文件夹的条目数、总占用大小和代表性条目（只读，不修改任何内容）。由于总大小需递归扫描、时长不定，采用受管后台方式执行：\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":2,\"round\":2,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":2,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-08 11:34:16'),
(2140, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 311, 'tool.started', 'file', 'moonya', 'file-overview', 'call_00_dcPOlsi1NjbBerT2Qtbl9537', '{\"tool_key\":\"shell_executor\",\"display_name\":\"Shell 执行器\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"powershell -NoProfile -Command \\\"$home=$env:USERPROFILE; $folders=@(\'Desktop\',\'Documents\',\'Downloads\',\'Pictures\',\'Videos\',\'Music\',\'Doubao\',\'WPS Cloud Files\',\'WPSDrive\',\'source\',\'AndroidStudioProjects\',\'ZCodeProject\',\'PyCharmMiscProject\',\'CodeBuddy\',\'WorkBuddy\'); foreach($f in $folders){ $p=Join-Path $home $f; if(Test-Path -LiteralPath $p){ $items=@(Get-ChildItem -Force -LiteralPath $p -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue); $count=$items.Count; $size=(Get-ChildItem -Force -Recurse -LiteralPath $p -File -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Measure-Object -Property Length -Sum).Sum; if($null -eq $size){$size=0}; $sizeMB=[math]::Round($size/1MB,1); $dirs=@($items | Where-Object {$_.PSIsContainer} | Select-Object -First 2 -ExpandProperty Name); $bigfile=@($items | Where-Object {-not $_.PSIsContainer} | Sort-Object Length -Descending | Select-Object -First 1 -ExpandProperty Name); $reps=@(); if($dirs.Count -gt 0){$reps+=(\'文件夹: \'+($dirs -join \'、\'))}; if($bigfile.Count -gt 0){$reps+=(\'文件: \'+$bigfile[0])}; $line=(\'{0}|条目={1}|大小={2}MB|代表={3}\' -f $f,$count,$sizeMB,($reps -join \' ; \')); Write-Output $line } }; Write-Output \'DONE\'\\\"\",\"shell\":\"cmd\",\"phase\":\"inspect\",\"operation_id\":\"inspect-home-folders\",\"intent\":\"只读统计用户主目录常见文件夹的顶层条目数、递归总大小及代表性条目名称\",\"success_criteria\":{\"expected_exit_code\":0,\"stdout_contains\":[\"DONE\"],\"stdout_regex\":[\"Desktop\\\\|条目=\\\\d+\"]},\"blocking\":false,\"completion_mode\":\"finite\"},\"effect\":\"read\",\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"phase\":\"inspect\",\"operation_id\":\"inspect-home-folders\",\"intent\":\"只读统计用户主目录常见文件夹的顶层条目数、递归总大小及代表性条目名称\",\"shell\":\"powershell\",\"command_fingerprint\":\"b039547371f27393096aa54318f7778f2ae5ae4a68769eda7a577b7bc8963a6d\"}', '2026-08-08 11:34:16'),
(2141, '0481997e-aeb2-45b2-b0a8-bd4234be168f', 313, 'tool.completed', 'file', 'moonya', 'file-overview', 'call_00_dcPOlsi1NjbBerT2Qtbl9537', '{\"tool_key\":\"shell_executor\",\"ok\":false,\"content\":\"无法覆盖变量 HOME，因为该变量为只读变量或常量。\\r\\n所在位置 D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\MoonYa\\\\MoonYa-Win\\\\MoonYa-Solution\\\\MoonYa\\\\bin\\\\x64\\\\Debug\\\\net8.0-windows10.0.19041.0\\\\sandbox_temp\\\\\\r\\ntask_665de65fef0045b6ba3916b6cd2da2a3\\\\script.ps1:1 字符: 1\\r\\n+ $home=$env:USERPROFILE; $folders=@(\'Desktop\',\'Documents\',\'Downloads\', ...\\r\\n+ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\\r\\n    + CategoryInfo          : WriteError: (HOME:String) [], SessionStateUnauthorizedAccessException\\r\\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : VariableNotWritable\\r\\n\",\"error\":{\"code\":\"background_command_failed\",\"message\":\"无法覆盖变量 HOME，因为该变量为只读变量或常量。\\r\\n所在位置 D:\\\\Project\\\\Project\\\\MoonYa\\\\MoonYa-Win\\\\MoonYa-Solution\\\\MoonYa\\\\bin\\\\x64\\\\Debug\\\\net8.0-windows10.0.19041.0\\\\sandbox_temp\\\\\\r\\ntask_665de65fef0045b6ba3916b6cd2da2a3\\\\script.ps1:1 字符: 1\\r\\n+ $home=$env:USERPROFILE; $folders=@(\'Desktop\',\'Documents\',\'Downloads\', ...\\r\\n+ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\\r\\n    + CategoryInfo          : WriteError: (HOME:String) [], SessionStateUnauthorizedAccessException\\r\\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : VariableNotWritable\\r\\n\"},\"stage\":null,\"status\":\"done\",\"error_code\":\"background_command_failed\",\"command_fingerprint\":null,\"operation_receipt\":{\"operation_id\":\"inspect-home-folders\",\"phase\":\"inspect\",\"state\":\"inspection_failed\",\"command_fingerprint\":\"b039547371f27393096aa54318f7778f2ae5ae4a68769eda7a577b7bc8963a6d\",\"intent\":\"只读统计用户主目录常见文件夹的顶层条目数、递归总大小及代表性条目名称\",\"completion_mode\":\"finite\",\"authoritative_verifier\":\"\",\"command_id\":\"1d2bf4662f99\"}}', '2026-08-08 11:34:16'),
