(2307, '36f5ade8-d69a-4f74-a7d5-ac8dc429bd14', 113, 'agent.turn.completed', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"36f5ade8-d69a-4f74-a7d5-ac8dc429bd14-moonya-turn-1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The user is asking me to open a browser and open the Kimi open platform (kimi.moonshot.cn likely). This is a task that involves launching a browser and navigating to a website.The task: \\\"打开浏览器打开kimi开放平台\\\" (Open browser and open Kimi open platform)\\n\\nThis is an executable task. According to my instructions, I must use delegate_to_agents for executable tasks.The user didn\'t specify a URL explicitly, but \\\"kimi开放平台\\\" is a known thing - Kimi by Moonshot AI. The open platform is at platform.moonshot.cn or kimi.moonshot.cn... Actually the Kimi open platform is at platform.moonshot.cn (Moonshot AI open platform).Hmm, but my instructions say: \\\"用户没有给出的网站、应用、账号、路径、数据源或其他环境事实，一律不得自行补全。不要因为一个常见名词可能存在于某个线上服务，就擅自把本机或上下文未限定的任务改写成该服务的登录流程。\\\"\\n\\nSo I shouldn\'t assume the URL. But the user asked to open \\\"kimi开放平台\\\" - this is a specific request. The question is how to split the task. Opening a browser and navigating to a webpage - which capability handles this?\\n\\n- app.lifecycle: launch/close Windows applications (like launching Chrome)\\n- browser.automation: open webpages and interact with elements- browser.page_extraction: read specified URLActually, to \\\"打开浏览器打开kimi开放平台\\\", we need to launch the browser app (app.lifecycle) and then navigate to the page (browser.automation or browser.page_extraction).The description for app.lifecycle:检测、下载、安装、启动、关闭或卸载 Windows应用 - launching an app is app.lifecycle.\\nbrowser.automation:打开网页并对网页元素执行导航、填写、点击和视觉分析 - opening a webpage and navigating is browser.automation.\\n\\nSo this would be a cross-role task: launch browser → then navigate to the kimi open platform page. So split into two tasks with depends_on:\\n\\n1. app.lifecycle: launch the default browser (or a browser)2. browser.automation: navigate to kimi open platformBut the URL issue: user didn\'t give URL. The environment could be confirmed by the agent. The instruction says: \\\"环境可由员工通过观察或只读工具确认时，先委派确认\\\".Actually for the navigation task, the agent could search for \\\"kimi开放平台\\\" or navigate to the known official URL. But my instructions say not to self-fill environment facts not given by the user. However, the user explicitly asked for \\\"kimi开放平台\\\" - the agent can search or navigate. Hmm.\\n\\nActually, the safest approach: delegate to launch browser (app.lifecycle), then browser.automation to open the kimi open platform. For the URL, the browser agent can determine the correct official site - perhaps via the search engine or known URL. But to avoid making assumptions, the browser agent could use a search to find the official platform. However that might be overcomplicating.\\n\\nLet me think about what\'s reasonable. \\\"kimi开放平台\\\" = Kimi Open Platform by Moonshot AI, official URL is platform.moonshot.cn. It\'s widely known. But per instructions, I shouldn\'t self-fill. But the agent (browser.automation) can observe and confirm - it can search or navigate to the official site.I think a reasonable split:\\n- Task1 (app.lifecycle):打开/启动系统默认浏览器 (launch default browser)\\n- Task2 (browser.automation, depends on task1):在浏览器中访问 kimi开放平台官网 (navigate to the Kimi open platform)\\n\\nFor the instruction, I can say:用户目标是打开 kimi开放平台。请确认浏览器已打开后，导航到 kimi开放平台的官方页面（若不确定网址，可通过只读搜索确认官方地址，不要登录或填写任何表单）。验收标准：浏览器当前页面显示 kimi开放平台首页。\\n\\nThat respects the constraint - the agent can confirm the environment/URL via observation.\\n\\nActually, should I let the agent search? The user just wants to open the platform. The browser agent with browser.automation can open the page. I\'ll instruct it to determine the official URL if needed.\\n\\nLet me write the delegation. First response must be either delegate_to_agents or respond_without_delegation. This is executable, so delegate.\\n\\nI\'ll create two tasks with dependency.\",\"content\":\"我来把\\\"打开浏览器并打开 kimi 开放平台\\\"拆成两个子任务：先启动浏览器，再在浏览器中导航到 kimi 开放平台页面。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":3666,\"received_content_chars\":60,\"summary\":\"我来把\\\"打开浏览器并打开 kimi 开放平台\\\"拆成两个子任务：先启动浏览器，再在浏览器中导航到 kimi 开放平台页面。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"phase\":\"planning\",\"round\":1,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\",\"http_status\":200},\"phase\":\"planning\",\"round\":1,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-09 00:21:42'),
(2308, '36f5ade8-d69a-4f74-a7d5-ac8dc429bd14', 114, 'delegation.accepted', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, 'call_00_TZUT3gLN3xoM1nRE8p8m3530', '{\"dispatch_status\":\"accepted\",\"tasks\":[{\"id\":\"launch-browser\",\"agent_key\":\"app\",\"capability_key\":\"app.lifecycle\",\"agent_display_name\":\"APP Agent\",\"instruction\":\"启动本机可用的默认浏览器（如 Chrome、Edge 等），确保浏览器窗口已打开并处于可用状态。验收标准：浏览器应用成功启动，窗口可见。\",\"depends_on\":[],\"selection_reason\":\"启动 Windows 浏览器应用属于应用生命周期管理能力。\"},{\"id\":\"open-kimi-platform\",\"agent_key\":\"browser\",\"capability_key\":\"browser.automation\",\"agent_display_name\":\"Browser Agent\",\"instruction\":\"在已打开的浏览器中导航到 kimi 开放平台（Kimi Open Platform，月之暗面 Moonshot AI 的开放平台）的官方页面。若不确定官方网址，可先通过只读搜索确认其官方入口，再访问。仅需打开平台首页，不要登录、填写表单或执行任何其他操作。验收标准：浏览器当前标签页成功加载并显示 kimi 开放平台首页。\",\"depends_on\":[\"launch-browser\"],\"selection_reason\":\"在网页中导航并确认页面加载属于浏览器自动化能力。\"}]}', '2026-08-09 00:21:42'),
(2309, '36f5ade8-d69a-4f74-a7d5-ac8dc429bd14', 115, 'agent.summary', 'moonya', NULL, NULL, 'call_00_TZUT3gLN3xoM1nRE8p8m3530', '{\"phase\":\"delegation\",\"title\":\"已完成团队分工\",\"announcement\":\"准备处理这项任务，已交给 APP Agent、Browser Agent 分工完成。\",\"summary\":\"MoonYa 根据任务专业领域和依赖关系选择了 2 个 Agent 任务。\",\"tasks\":[{\"id\":\"launch-browser\",\"agent_key\":\"app\",\"capability_key\":\"app.lifecycle\",\"agent_display_name\":\"APP Agent\",\"instruction\":\"启动本机可用的默认浏览器（如 Chrome、Edge 等），确保浏览器窗口已打开并处于可用状态。验收标准：浏览器应用成功启动，窗口可见。\",\"depends_on\":[],\"selection_reason\":\"启动 Windows 浏览器应用属于应用生命周期管理能力。\"},{\"id\":\"open-kimi-platform\",\"agent_key\":\"browser\",\"capability_key\":\"browser.automation\",\"agent_display_name\":\"Browser Agent\",\"instruction\":\"在已打开的浏览器中导航到 kimi 开放平台（Kimi Open Platform，月之暗面 Moonshot AI 的开放平台）的官方页面。若不确定官方网址，可先通过只读搜索确认其官方入口，再访问。仅需打开平台首页，不要登录、填写表单或执行任何其他操作。验收标准：浏览器当前标签页成功加载并显示 kimi 开放平台首页。\",\"depends_on\":[\"launch-browser\"],\"selection_reason\":\"在网页中导航并确认页面加载属于浏览器自动化能力。\"}]}', '2026-08-09 00:21:42'),
