(2329, '36f5ade8-d69a-4f74-a7d5-ac8dc429bd14', 229, 'agent.turn.completed', 'browser', 'moonya', 'open-kimi-platform', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"open-kimi-platform-turn-1\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The user wants me to navigate to the Kimi Open Platform official page. The browser has been launched by a previous task. I need to first confirm the official URL through a read-only search, then navigate to it.\\n\\nLet me start the browser automation and navigate. Actually, the browser is already launched. Let me first confirm the official URL. The Kimi Open Platform official site is platform.moonshot.cn. Let me verify by searching or just navigating.\\n\\nLet me use the browser automation to navigate to the platform. First, let me check the current browser state and possibly search for the official entrance.\\n\\nLet me start the browser automation and navigate to the official URL. I believe the official URL is https://platform.moonshot.cn/. Let me first do a quick search to confirm.\\n\\nLet me start the browser automation control and navigate. Actually, since browser is already launched, I should use navigate action.\\n\\nLet me first do a read-only search to confirm the official URL. I can use web_fetch to fetch a search engine. Let me try navigating to the search result.\\n\\nActually, let me be efficient. I\'ll use browser_automation_control to navigate. First, let me navigate to a search to confirm the official entrance, or directly navigate to platform.moonshot.cn and verify.\\n\\nLet me do both: navigate to the official URL, and also I could verify via search. Let me start by navigating the browser.\\n\\nI\'ll navigate to the Kimi Open Platform. The known official site is https://platform.moonshot.cn. Let me verify with a quick search first using web_fetch of a search engine.\\n\\nLet me use browser automation to navigate first to Bing search to confirm official URL. Actually, let me use web_fetch to check. Let me just navigate the browser directly.\\n\\nLet me first start the browser automation control (in case it needs to attach) and then navigate.\",\"content\":\"我来完成这个任务。首先确认 kimi 开放平台的官方入口，再导航到该页面。\\n\\n让我先通过只读搜索确认官方网址，并同时检查浏览器状态。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":1850,\"received_content_chars\":66,\"summary\":\"我来完成这个任务。首先确认 kimi 开放平台的官方入口，再导航到该页面。 让我先通过只读搜索确认官方网址，并同时检查浏览器状态。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":1,\"round\":1,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":1,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-09 00:21:56'),
