(2352, '36f5ade8-d69a-4f74-a7d5-ac8dc429bd14', 317, 'agent.turn.completed', 'browser', 'moonya', 'open-kimi-platform', NULL, '{\"turn_id\":\"open-kimi-platform-turn-5\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"reasoning_content\":\"The browser automation control service is consistently failing with \\\"未知路由: POST /browser/execute\\\". This seems to be a backend routing issue where the browser automation backend is not properly connected.\\n\\nLet me try the web_crawler tool to at least verify the page content and confirm the official URL. But the task requires loading the page in the browser\'s current tab.\\n\\nLet me retry the browser automation a few times - maybe it\'s a transient issue. Actually, the error is consistent across multiple calls, so it\'s likely a persistent backend issue.\\n\\nLet me try web_crawler to at least verify the page exists and get content, and also try web_fetch with different approach.\\n\\nActually, let me first verify the official URL. Let me try to fetch the platform page with web_fetch using a different method. The web_fetch failed with timeout to a proxy IP. \\n\\nLet me try web_crawler on platform.moonshot.cn. Actually web_crawler downloads the page locally - that\'s a heavier operation. But it could verify the URL is valid.\\n\\nLet me retry the browser automation once more, perhaps with navigate only. Maybe the start action isn\'t needed since browser is already launched per context. But navigate also failed with the same route error.\\n\\nThe issue seems to be with the backend service routing, not with the browser itself. Let me try the vls_analyze_browser again - it says browser not started.\\n\\nLet me try a sequence: maybe I need to call start then navigate. But start is failing.\\n\\nLet me retry once more after a short pause, and also try web_crawler to verify the page.\",\"content\":\"浏览器自动化后端服务持续返回路由错误。让我先通过爬虫工具验证目标页面真实可用并确认官方入口，同时再次重试浏览器启动。\",\"content_discarded\":false,\"received_reasoning_chars\":1566,\"received_content_chars\":58,\"summary\":\"浏览器自动化后端服务持续返回路由错误。让我先通过爬虫工具验证目标页面真实可用并确认官方入口，同时再次重试浏览器启动。\",\"metadata\":{\"model\":\"deepseek-v4-flash\",\"iteration\":5,\"round\":5,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"},\"round\":5,\"phase\":\"execution\",\"project_group_id\":\"\",\"actor_id\":\"\",\"role_key\":\"\",\"role_label\":\"\",\"workstream\":\"\",\"owned_paths\":[],\"depends_on\":[],\"project_phase\":\"execution\",\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\"}', '2026-08-09 00:22:40'),
